#: - Cyber HK.html:4389 HSBC _ and engineering fraud frontend/templates/Avoid
#: scams security social
msgid "Avoid social engineering scams"
msgstr "如何防範「社交工程」詐騙？"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4411 HSBC _ and engineering fraud frontend/templates/Avoid
#: scams security social
msgid "How to protect yourself against social engineering scams"
msgstr "如何防範「社交工程」陷阱"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4416 HSBC _ and engineering fraud frontend/templates/Avoid
#: scams security social
msgid ""
"It’s 10pm when your phone rings. The man on the other end tells you he’s "
"a police inspector from Guangdong Province and that you could be in "
"serious legal trouble."
msgstr "電話在晚上10時響起，對方自稱是廣東省公安，指您可能已捲入嚴重的案件之中。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4422 HSBC _ and engineering fraud frontend/templates/Avoid
#: scams security social
msgid ""
"It seems your name has appeared on several suspicious business contracts "
"involving illegal imports and exports. The authorities have serious "
"concerns that you might be involved in trafficking."
msgstr "您的姓名似乎在多份非法進出口的可疑商業合約中出現，當局正懷疑，您可能是從事非法貿易的不法分子。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4425 HSBC _ and engineering fraud frontend/templates/Avoid
#: scams security social
msgid ""
"The caller begins to question your finances. He knows about the smart TV "
"you just bought, the vacation you took to Okinawa, the lavish meal you "
"had at that Michelin star restaurant last week. He asks if you are the "
"one paying for your nephew’s university in Canada."
msgstr "來電者開始詢問您的財務狀況。他知道您剛買了一台智能電視、到過沖繩度假，又知道您上星期去了米芝蓮星級餐廳享用大餐。他再詢問您，外甥在加拿大的大學學費是否由您支付。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4428 HSBC _ and engineering fraud frontend/templates/Avoid
#: scams security social
msgid ""
"He tells you they have more evidence, too – but perhaps it’s a mistake. "
"Perhaps you got mixed up with gangsters who have tricked you into shady "
"business dealings. Or maybe your account has been hacked, and is being "
"used to cover illegal transactions."
msgstr "他又告訴您他們還有更多證據，但也可能純屬誤會。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4431 HSBC _ and engineering fraud frontend/templates/Avoid
#: scams security social
msgid ""
"He tells you that you can be cleared of any wrongdoing if you cooperate "
"with the authorities in their investigation. The first step, he says, is "
"to give him your bank account information, so they can monitor it for any"
" suspicious activity."
msgstr "您可能不知道自己被犯罪分子牽涉在不當買賣之中，或者您的賬戶遭人盜取，被用作掩飾非法交易。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4434 HSBC _ and engineering fraud frontend/templates/Avoid
#: scams security social
msgid ""
"He tells you don’t hang up. This is your only chance. Provide your log on"
" details now, or your account will be frozen and you'll face prosecution "
"to the fullest extent of the law."
msgstr "他叫您不要掛線，這是您的唯一辯解機會。您必須即時提供銀行登入資訊，否則您的賬戶將被凍結，而您亦會面臨最重的刑罰。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4441 HSBC _ and engineering fraud frontend/templates/Avoid
#: scams security social
msgid "Don’t do it. It’s a scam."
msgstr ""

#: - Cyber HK.html:4452 HSBC _ and engineering fraud frontend/templates/Avoid
#: scams security social
msgid ""
"This is what is known as a “social engineering scam”. Sometimes the story"
" will be about tax evasion. Other times the con artists will claim that "
"your relative is in serious legal trouble. But in general with these "
"scams, criminals pose as officials and try to get you to share your bank "
"details, or to transfer money directly to them."
msgstr ""
"這就是「社交工程」（social "
"engineering）詐騙，有時騙徒會說您逃稅，有時又會訛稱您的親屬已捲入嚴重的法律糾紛。但一般而言，犯罪者在這些騙案中都自稱是政府人員，試圖游說您提供銀行資料，或直接向他們匯款。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4455 HSBC _ and engineering fraud frontend/templates/Avoid
#: scams security social
msgid ""
"Consider the story you just read. A convincing fraudster could make you "
"think that they knew these details because they had high-level government"
" access. But take a closer look at the “facts” they knew about you."
msgstr "想想剛才的故事：騙徒言之鑿鑿，的確有可能令您相信，他們身居政府要職，所以有您的資料。但是，請再三思考一下他們對您的「認識」。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4458 HSBC _ and engineering fraud frontend/templates/Avoid
#: scams security social
msgid ""
"Your trip to Okinawa. Your new TV. Your expensive meal. Your nephew in "
"Canada."
msgstr "您的沖繩之旅、新電視、奢華晚餐，還有在加拿大的外甥。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4461 HSBC _ and engineering fraud frontend/templates/Avoid
#: scams security social
msgid ""
"These are all common social media posts. Maybe you Instagrammed your "
"trip. You thanked your Facebook friends for helping you decide on the "
"best TV for your budget. You wrote a review for that anniversary dinner. "
"And maybe you left a simple “Happy Birthday!” on your nephew’s wall, and "
"his profile shows that he’s studying in Vancouver."
msgstr "這都是社交媒體帖文的常見內容。您或許曾在Instagram發布旅程照片，又在Facebook感謝好友幫您選購合預算的電視。您又可能曾經為那次周年紀念晚餐寫過食評。在外甥生日時，您也可能在他的社交媒體送上簡單祝福，而他的個人檔案顯示他正在溫哥華留學。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4464 HSBC _ and engineering fraud frontend/templates/Avoid
#: scams security social
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"But fraudsters aren't always stalking your online profile. Sometimes they"
" just play the odds. They'll say things like:"
msgstr "但是，騙徒不只會利用您在網上發布的資訊。有時，他們會碰碰運氣，以這些說法開場："

#: - Cyber HK.html:4504 HSBC _ and engineering fraud frontend/templates/Avoid
#: scams security social
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"These are things that could sound true for most Hongkongers. Lots of "
"people visit family in Mainland China. Many of them also have a local "
"number there. And who doesn't shop from Taobao now and then?"
msgstr "這些說法，其實可能說中了大部分香港人。到內地探親、在內地登記手機號碼的人多不勝數。而且，有誰不會間中在淘寶購物？"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4512 HSBC _ and engineering fraud frontend/templates/Avoid
#: scams security social
msgid "Fortunately, there are ways to protect yourself:"
msgstr "幸好，您可以用這些方式保護自己："

#: - Cyber HK.html:4522 HSBC _ and engineering fraud frontend/templates/Avoid
#: scams security social
msgid "Stay calm"
msgstr "保持冷靜"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4536 HSBC _ and engineering fraud frontend/templates/Avoid
#: scams security social
msgid "Be aware of what you share online"
msgstr "時刻注意自己在網上分享的內容"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4550 HSBC _ and engineering fraud frontend/templates/Avoid
#: scams security social
msgid ""
"Never give your account details – especially your log on information – to"
" anyone"
msgstr "切勿向他人提供自己的賬戶資料，尤其是登入資訊"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4565 HSBC _ and engineering fraud frontend/templates/Avoid
#: scams security social
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If you receive a suspicious call, hang up immediately and report it to us"
" by calling (852) 2233 3000"
msgstr "如接獲可疑來電，請立即掛線，並致電+852 2233 3000向我們舉報。"

