#: security
msgid "How to spot and avoid cheque scams"
msgstr "如何避免支票詐騙陷阱"

#: - And Cheque Cyber Fraud HK.html:4398 HSBC Scams Security _
#: frontend/templates/Avoiding
msgid ""
"Scammers have endless tricks up their sleeves. Did you know that some "
"scammers temporarily inflate your ledger balance to cheat you out of "
"goods or money?"
msgstr "騙徒會設法令您戶口的賬面結餘暫時增加，騙取貨物和金錢！"

#: - And Cheque Cyber Fraud HK.html:4405 HSBC Scams Security _
#: frontend/templates/Avoiding
msgid "Ledger balance vs available balance"
msgstr "賬面結餘vs可用結餘"

#: - And Cheque Cyber Fraud HK.html:4412 HSBC Scams Security _
#: frontend/templates/Avoiding
msgid ""
"First, let's look at how to understand your balance. When you log on to "
"online or mobile banking, you'll see 2 different balances."
msgstr "先看看應如何理解戶口結餘。登入網上或流動理財後，會見到兩個不同的結餘金額。"

#: - And Cheque Cyber Fraud HK.html:4415 HSBC Scams Security _
#: frontend/templates/Avoiding
msgid ""
"Ledger balance may include cheques that have been deposited but have not "
"yet been cleared for withdrawal. It's for reference only."
msgstr "其中一個是賬面結餘，可包括存入但未結算以供提取的支票，這個金額只供參考。"

#: - And Cheque Cyber Fraud HK.html:4418 HSBC Scams Security _
#: frontend/templates/Avoiding
msgid ""
"Available balance is the amount of money you have in your account that "
"can be withdrawn."
msgstr "另一個是可用結餘，是指戶口內實際可供提取的款項。"

#: - And Cheque Cyber Fraud HK.html:4425 HSBC Scams Security _
#: frontend/templates/Avoiding
msgid "How do cheque scams work?"
msgstr "「彈票黨」出沒注意！"

#: - And Cheque Cyber Fraud HK.html:4432 HSBC Scams Security _
#: frontend/templates/Avoiding
msgid ""
"Scammers cash an invalid cheque to their target’s account, giving victims"
" the false impression that they've been paid."
msgstr "「彈票黨」騙徒會存入無效支票，令受害人誤以為自己已經收妥款項。"

#: - And Cheque Cyber Fraud HK.html:4435 HSBC Scams Security _
#: frontend/templates/Avoiding
msgid ""
"When a cheque is deposited, the ledger balance is updated right away to "
"reflect the cheque amount, even though it hasn't been cleared yet. It "
"usually takes 1 to 2 working days for the cheque to clear and the amount "
"only becomes available upon successful clearance."
msgstr "存入支票之後，戶口的賬面結餘會即時更新，反映支票金額，但支票其實需要1至2個工作天才完成結算，成功結算為可動用款項後，才會轉為可用結餘。"

#: - And Cheque Cyber Fraud HK.html:4438 HSBC Scams Security _
#: frontend/templates/Avoiding
msgid ""
"Scammers take advantage of this time gap to defraud victims with invalid "
"cheque payments. After seeing an increase in the ledger balance, or being"
" presented with a forged payment proof without checking the available "
"balance, unsuspecting people may deliver goods or pay money. The invalid "
"cheque then fails to clear and they realise they've been scammed."
msgstr "騙徒利用支票結算的時間差距，以無效支票付款進行詐騙。受害人見到戶口的賬面結餘增加，或收到偽造的交易紀錄，而又沒有查清楚可用結餘，就會誤墜陷阱，在沒有防備之下交出貨物或支付金錢，直到一兩日後支票沒有兌現，才發現被騙。"

#: - And Cheque Cyber Fraud HK.html:4469 HSBC Scams Security _
#: frontend/templates/Avoiding
msgid "Common techniques used by scammers"
msgstr "「彈票黨」常用技倆"

#: - And Cheque Cyber Fraud HK.html:4476 HSBC Scams Security _
#: frontend/templates/Avoiding
msgid ""
"Learning more about how scammers work can help prevent you from falling "
"into their traps."
msgstr "了解「彈票黨」如何運作，可以避免墜入支票詐騙陷阱。"

#: - And Cheque Cyber Fraud HK.html:4479 HSBC Scams Security _
#: frontend/templates/Avoiding
msgid ""
"Scammers often target sellers on social media or trading platforms. They "
"pretend to be customers and use invalid cheques in exchange for high-"
"value goods."
msgstr "騙徒通常在社交媒體或買賣交易平台出沒，假扮成買家，用無效支票購買貴價貨品。"

#: - And Cheque Cyber Fraud HK.html:4482 HSBC Scams Security _
#: frontend/templates/Avoiding
msgid ""
"There are scammers who deposit large sums of money with invalid cheques "
"and ask victims to send back the difference. In this case, the victims "
"deliver goods and pay scammers money, resulting in a double loss."
msgstr "有些騙徒會用無效支票假裝存入大量金額，然後要求受害人發回差額，令受害人不止被騙去貨物，更付出真金白銀退款，遭受雙重損失。"

#: - And Cheque Cyber Fraud HK.html:4493 HSBC Scams Security _
#: frontend/templates/Avoiding
msgid ""
"Hello, I'm Mr Chan from ABC School. Can you help us order 100 mattresses?"
" We can pay you a high commission."
msgstr "喂？我係ABC中學嘅陳老師呀。可唔可以幫學校買100張床褥？我哋會俾好高佣金您。"

#: - And Cheque Cyber Fraud HK.html:4502 HSBC Scams Security _
#: frontend/templates/Avoiding
msgid ""
"Some scammers ask victims to buy goods from fake suppliers with a high "
"commission as bait. They pose as schoolteachers or charitable "
"organisations to appear trustworthy, and trick companies into making "
"payments to fake suppliers on their behalf. They deposit invalid cheques "
"to forge payment proofs and take advantage of the clearing time before "
"the cheques bounce. After seeing an increase in their ledger balance, "
"victims pay the fake suppliers with their own money and suffer financial "
"loss."
msgstr ""
"部分騙徒以高佣金為餌，誘騙受害人向假供應商入貨。他們會假扮成學校教師或慈善團體以獲取信任，哄騙公司代他們向假供應商付款入貨。騙徒存入空頭支票，利用彈票前的支票結算時間製造已付款的假象。受害人見到戶口的賬面結餘增加後，自掏腰包付款給假供應商，"
" 遭受金錢損失。"

#: - And Cheque Cyber Fraud HK.html:4505 HSBC Scams Security _
#: frontend/templates/Avoiding
msgid ""
"In some cases, scammers use counterfeit cashier's orders to pay victims. "
"Similar to cheques, it takes 1 to 2 working days for banks to process a "
"cashier's order. Victims may not realise they've been scammed until the "
"counterfeit cashier’s order is returned by the bank."
msgstr "騙徒有時更會偽造本票作案騙人。本票和支票都需要一至兩個工作天結算，所以受害人很大機會在銀行退回偽造本票時才知道被騙。"

#: - And Cheque Cyber Fraud HK.html:4512 HSBC Scams Security _
#: frontend/templates/Avoiding
msgid "How to spot and prevent cheque scams"
msgstr "提防支票騙案"

#: - And Cheque Cyber Fraud HK.html:4519 HSBC Scams Security _
#: frontend/templates/Avoiding
msgid ""
"When collecting payments, always check your available balance, rather "
"than relying on a deposit slip or your ledger balance as proof of "
"transfer. Also, avoid rushing to comply with a request or to pay in "
"advance, even if the potential gain is high."
msgstr "收款時緊記檢查清楚戶口可用結餘，不應單靠入數紙或賬面結餘作轉賬證明。而且，就算回報多高，都不應急於答應對方要求，或提前付款。"

#: - And Cheque Cyber Fraud HK.html:4522 HSBC Scams Security _
#: frontend/templates/Avoiding
msgid ""
"If you receive a call from someone claiming to be from an organisation or"
" institution, do a thorough background check. Verify their identity with "
"official contact information or directories."
msgstr "如果接到自稱來自某組織或某機構的電話，應該仔細查核對方背景，用官方聯絡資訊或成員通訊錄驗證他們的身份。"

#: - And Cheque Cyber Fraud HK.html:4525 HSBC Scams Security _
#: frontend/templates/Avoiding
msgid ""
"When in doubt, make good use of fraud-fighting resources, such as "
"Scameter or the Scameter+ application, to assess the risk of suspicious "
"numbers, URLs, payment accounts and so on."
msgstr "如有懷疑，可使用「防騙視伏器」、「防騙視伏App」應用程式等防騙資源，評估可疑電話號碼、網址、支付賬戶等的風險。"

#: - And Cheque Cyber Fraud HK.html:4532 HSBC Scams Security _
#: frontend/templates/Avoiding
msgid ""
"HSBC is committed to protecting your financial security. Think you might "
"have come across a cheque scam? Please contact us at:"
msgstr "滙豐致力保障您的財務安全。懷疑自己遭遇支票詐騙？請即聯絡我們："

