#: - Cyber HK.html:9 HSBC Let's Safeguard_ _ and crime fight financial fraud
#: frontend/templates/HSBC security
msgid ""
"HSBC Safeguard: Let's fight financial crime | Cyber security and fraud - "
"HSBC HK"
msgstr "HSBC Safeguard：同心打擊金融罪案 | 網絡安全及防詐騙資訊 - 香港滙豐"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4411 HSBC Let's Safeguard_ _ and crime fight financial fraud
#: frontend/templates/HSBC security
msgid "HSBC Safeguard"
msgstr "HSBC Safeguard"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4418 HSBC Let's Safeguard_ _ and crime fight financial fraud
#: frontend/templates/HSBC security
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Financial crime is a growing global issue and can affect everyone. Banks "
"play a vital role in protecting the integrity of the financial system "
"upon which we all depend and HSBC is committed to meeting the highest "
"standards in its controls against financial crime.  As a trusted banking "
"partner in Hong Kong with over 150 years of history, we have made it "
"easier and safer for customers to update information and access banking. "
"We want to work with our customers to keep criminals out of Hong Kong.  "
"Having your accurate and up-to-date information is critical to our "
"efforts in detecting and deterring these criminals."
msgstr "金融罪案構成的威脅是一個全球正面對的問題，並能影響所有人。銀行對保障健全的金融系統扮演非常重要的角色，因此，滙豐致力採取措施，以助打擊金融罪案。滙豐在香港擁有超過150年的歷史，作為你可信賴的夥伴，我們竭力提供更安全便捷的銀行服務。要偵測及防範金融罪案，有賴我們同心協力。準確和最新的客戶資料，有助我們阻止不法分子入侵金融系統。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4422 HSBC Let's Safeguard_ _ and crime fight financial fraud
#: frontend/templates/HSBC security
msgid ""
"Criminals who try to access the financial system harm lives and "
"communities everywhere, through activities such as human trafficking and "
"illegal drug trading, as well as fraud and identity theft. We believe "
"these issues matter to everyone and we want to work with our customers to"
" fight these criminals."
msgstr "不法分子一直試圖利用金融系統，進行人口販賣、非法毒品交易、欺詐及身分盜竊等危害人命和社會的活動。我們期望能與客戶攜手，共同打擊一切詐騙及非法行為。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4431 HSBC Let's Safeguard_ _ and crime fight financial fraud
#: frontend/templates/HSBC security
msgid ""
"To succeed, we need more information about our customers than in the "
"past: from customers opening new accounts, to existing customers. "
"Understanding who we bank with, the source of their wealth and the "
"purpose of banking with HSBC is vital to preventing financial crime. This"
" is why we have launched HSBC Safeguard."
msgstr ""
"要成功打擊金融罪案，我們需要比以往更多的客戶資料，包括新客戶及現有客戶。深入了解個人及公司客戶、資金來源以至開立滙豐戶口的目的，對防範金融罪案至為重要。因此，我們特別推出一系列「HSBC"
" Safeguard」措施。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4434 HSBC Let's Safeguard_ _ and crime fight financial fraud
#: frontend/templates/HSBC security
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"From time to time, we request up-to-date information from our customers. "
"We understand these kinds of requests from banks can take up time in your"
" busy schedule and we want to thank you in advance for helping us in the "
"fight against financial crime. We have invested in our digital platforms "
"to make it more convenient for our business customers to respond to our "
"requests online and upload supporting documents.  We will continue to "
"enhance our digital platforms to enable our customers to respond to us "
"with ease."
msgstr "我們會不時要求客戶提供最新資料，我們明白相關措施會佔用你的寶貴時間，並衷心感謝你協助我們打擊金融罪行，共創安心未來。我們已優化網上平台，以便商業客戶能簡易地更新客戶資料及上載所需文件。我們將持續更新技術，以便更多客戶能透過網上平台作出回應。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4444 HSBC Let's Safeguard_ _ and crime fight financial fraud
#: frontend/templates/HSBC security
msgid ""
"Updating existing customer information and collecting new customer "
"information ensures that our systems and processes are better able to "
"protect the integrity of the financial system. We take our obligation to "
"protect your data very seriously, so all information you provide will be "
"subject to HSBC's high data and security standards."
msgstr "藉著更新現有客戶資料及收集新客戶資料，便能確保我們的系統及程序更有效地維持健全金融體制。我們會嚴謹保護客戶資料，因此你所提供的所有資料，均受滙豐高級別的資料及安全標準所保障。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4447 HSBC Let's Safeguard_ _ and crime fight financial fraud
#: frontend/templates/HSBC security
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If you are using any of our mobile apps, you are protected with a suite "
"of advanced technologies: logon with biometric authentication (such as "
"Android™ Fingerprint ID, iOS Touch ID and Face ID), transaction "
"verification, strong data encryption, automatic time-out feature, SMS "
"notification etc.  All of these features aim to let you enjoy simpler and"
" faster access to mobile banking, plus bank-grade security to give you "
"peace of mind."
msgstr ""
"如你使用我們的流動應用程式，你可以透過先進科技獲得保護，包括生物認證 (例如：Android™ 指紋認證、iOS Touch ID及Face "
"ID) "
"迅速登入、交易驗證功能、強大的數據加密、自動「操作時段逾時」功能、交易短訊提示等。以上各項功能，旨在為你提供更簡易快捷的銀行服務，及享有銀行級別的安全保障，令你放心處理賬務。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4456 HSBC Let's Safeguard_ _ and crime fight financial fraud
#: frontend/templates/HSBC security
msgid ""
"You do not need to do anything at the moment. We will be contacting "
"customers individually when we need additional or updated information."
msgstr "你暫時毋須採取任何行動。如我們需要你提供額外或更新現有的資料，我們將與你聯絡，通知有關詳情。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4474 HSBC Let's Safeguard_ _ and crime fight financial fraud
#: frontend/templates/HSBC security
msgid "Frequently Asked Questions"
msgstr "常見問題"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4483 HSBC Let's Safeguard_ _ and crime fight financial fraud
#: frontend/templates/HSBC security
msgid "About HSBC Safeguard"
msgstr "有關 ｢HSBC Safeguard｣"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4502 HSBC Let's Safeguard_ _ and crime fight financial fraud
#: frontend/templates/HSBC security
msgid ""
"HSBC Safeguard is a series of initiatives designed to keep criminals out "
"of the financial system. It involves strengthening our ability to detect "
"and deter money laundering and evasion of sanctions as these activities "
"harm lives and communities. We request the most up-to-date information "
"from our customers, which could include the source of their wealth and "
"the purpose of their relationships with us. By better understanding "
"these, we will be able to prevent criminal actions that abuse the "
"financial system."
msgstr ""
"「HSBC "
"Safeguard」是一系列用作杜絕金融犯罪分子的保障措施。當中包括提升本行打擊清洗黑錢及逃避金融制裁的能力，這兩項均是金融罪案背後的常見動機並能影響每個人。我們會要求客戶提供最新資料如資金來源以至在滙豐開立戶口的目的。這些資料可助我們更了解客戶及防範不法分子利用金融系統犯案。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4505 HSBC Let's Safeguard_ _ and crime fight financial fraud
#: frontend/templates/HSBC security
msgid ""
"In addition, we will no longer be offering products such as travellers' "
"cheques, as we believe they are no longer safe enough for our customers "
"to convert money. We may review other products like this over time."
msgstr "此外，我們將不再提供一些在兌換貨幣過程中安全度不足的產品，例如：旅行支票等。而我們亦會不時檢討其他產品，並作出相關修訂措施。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4516 HSBC Let's Safeguard_ _ and crime fight financial fraud
#: frontend/templates/HSBC security
msgid ""
"Fraud and financial crimes are forms of theft. They tend to involve money"
" or property that are gained illegally, and used in a deceptive or "
"illegal manner to gain benefits from the proceeds. In today's complex "
"economy, financial crimes can take many forms, including money "
"laundering, sanction breaches, fraud, tax evasion, terrorist financing, "
"bribery, and corruption."
msgstr "欺詐和金融罪案是盜竊行為，往往涉及以非法方式獲得金錢或財產，或透過欺騙及非法手段獲得利益。在現今複雜的經濟體系，金融罪案可以多種形式進行，包括清洗黑錢、違反金融制裁、詐騙、逃稅、恐怖分子融資、賄賂及受賄。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4527 HSBC Let's Safeguard_ _ and crime fight financial fraud
#: frontend/templates/HSBC security
msgid ""
"Sanctions are a policy tool which national governments and organisations "
"such as the United Nations and European Union use to constrain and deter "
"perceived threats to their security, or to require international conduct "
"to conform to recognised international standards. Sanctions help stop "
"crimes like terrorism, drug trafficking and arms dealing by imposing "
"restrictions on the business that banks can do with specific people, "
"corporations, countries or territories. The names of these are clearly "
"listed on resources like the Office of Foreign Assets Control (OFAC) "
"sanctions list."
msgstr "金融制裁是一種政策工具，是各地政府及機構如聯合國及歐盟等用以限制或阻止一些潛在威脅安全的活動，或以此要求執行一致行動以符合公認的國際標準。金融制裁是透過限制銀行與已被列入美國財政部海外資產控制辦公室（OFAC）及其他制裁名單的特定人士、公司、國家或地區進行業務往來，從而協助制止恐怖主義、販毒及軍火交易等犯罪活動。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4538 HSBC Let's Safeguard_ _ and crime fight financial fraud
#: frontend/templates/HSBC security
msgid ""
"Fighting financial crime has been a longstanding priority for HSBC. "
"However, criminal activity has become increasingly sophisticated in "
"recent years. Fraudsters, money launderers and others have persistently "
"targeted the global networks of financial institutions."
msgstr "打擊金融罪案是滙豐一直以來的首要重任。然而，近年金融罪案越趨複雜，詐騙及清洗黑錢等犯罪分子已經試圖以全球金融機構作為目標。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4541 HSBC Let's Safeguard_ _ and crime fight financial fraud
#: frontend/templates/HSBC security
msgid ""
"Improving the way we share and manage customer information will help us "
"fight against the risk of financial crime. After all, it's our duty to "
"ensure that you can bank with us safely, securely and confidently."
msgstr "提升我們管理及共用客戶資料的運作模式，將有助打擊金融罪案。因為滙豐肩負著為客戶提供安全、穩健及可靠銀行服務的重任。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4551 HSBC Let's Safeguard_ _ and crime fight financial fraud
#: frontend/templates/HSBC security
msgid ""
"We understand your concerns and would like to take this opportunity to "
"thank you for using our banking services. As a responsible bank, keeping "
"customer account information accurate and up to date is key to making "
"banking more secure for customers and fighting financial crime. We thank "
"you for your understanding and support."
msgstr "我們明白你的顧慮，亦希望藉此機會感謝你多年來一直選用我們的銀行服務。作為一家負責任的銀行，打擊金融罪案及確保客戶資料準確齊全，旨在為你提供更安全的理財服務。在此我們感謝你的諒解及配合。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4561 HSBC Let's Safeguard_ _ and crime fight financial fraud
#: frontend/templates/HSBC security
msgid ""
"We understand your concerns and appreciate that you may have been using "
"HSBC to meet your banking needs for a long period of time. As fraud and "
"financial crime are becoming increasingly sophisticated, we need to adopt"
" measures to better manage financial crime risk. Therefore, from time to "
"time, we do need to update our customer records to ensure they are "
"current and complete."
msgstr "我們非常明白你的顧慮，亦感謝你一直選用滙豐。由於欺詐及金融罪案愈來愈複雜，為更有效管理金融罪案的風險，我們需要採取新措施，不時更新客戶紀錄，以確保客戶資料準確齊全。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4571 HSBC Let's Safeguard_ _ and crime fight financial fraud
#: frontend/templates/HSBC security
msgid ""
"We need to periodically conduct reviews with customers in order to obtain"
" the most relevant and up-to-date information. This is to ensure that all"
" of the information we have is accurate, up to date and covers details "
"that you haven't provided before or weren't previously required. The "
"information you provide will help us protect your account from potential "
"misuse and the community from financial crime."
msgstr "為確保客戶資料齊全及準確，我們會定期向客戶要求提交相關所需及最新的資料，當中可能包括客戶以往未有提供或我們未曾向客戶索取的資料。你所提供的資料，可助我們保障你的戶口及社會免受潛在的金融罪案所影響。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4581 HSBC Let's Safeguard_ _ and crime fight financial fraud
#: frontend/templates/HSBC security
msgid ""
"Financial crime and fraud can affect everyone. As the world becomes "
"increasingly connected and information moves around at a greater pace, "
"there are unfortunately greater opportunities for criminals to misuse the"
" financial system."
msgstr "金融罪案與欺詐能影響所有人。隨著國際間聯繫越趨緊密，資訊流動變得迅速，犯罪分子容易利用金融體系犯事。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4584 HSBC Let's Safeguard_ _ and crime fight financial fraud
#: frontend/templates/HSBC security
msgid ""
"From time to time, we need to verify the origins of the funds as part of "
"our ongoing efforts to track our customers' legitimate funds. Criminals "
"will try to appear to be law-abiding citizens or businesses, and "
"therefore we need to request relevant documents from our customers in "
"order to understand them and their account transactions."
msgstr "所以我們有時需核實客戶的資金來源，持續了解客戶的合法資金去向。犯罪分子表面上與守法的公民或企業無異，所以我們會要求客戶提供有關證明文件，從而了解客戶及其戶口交易。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4594 HSBC Let's Safeguard_ _ and crime fight financial fraud
#: frontend/templates/HSBC security
msgid ""
"Constant changes in technology and the way companies do business have "
"affected the whole banking industry and, in turn, how we protect it. "
"Fraud and financial crime are becoming even more sophisticated and "
"globally organised - so we have to be more vigilant than ever. We need "
"you to help us stay one step ahead of financial crime by providing us "
"with up-to-date information."
msgstr "科技不斷發展及企業營運模式的轉變均對整個銀行業帶來影響，而我們的安全保障措施亦須相應改變。欺詐及金融罪案愈來愈複雜及趨國際化，因此，我們必須加倍警惕。我們需要你的協助，提供最新資料，以助我們進一步打擊金融罪案。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4612 HSBC Let's Safeguard_ _ and crime fight financial fraud
#: frontend/templates/HSBC security
#, fuzzy
msgid "HSBC Safeguard and you"
msgstr "｢HSBC Safeguard｣ 與你&nbsp;"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4631 HSBC Let's Safeguard_ _ and crime fight financial fraud
#: frontend/templates/HSBC security
msgid ""
"If you are a personal customer, we will likely ask for your identity "
"proof to confirm your identity and maybe more relevant documents such as "
"address proof as required."
msgstr "個人客戶或須提交身分證明，或因應需要提供更多相關文件，如住址證明等。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4634 HSBC Let's Safeguard_ _ and crime fight financial fraud
#: frontend/templates/HSBC security
msgid ""
"If you are a business customer, the documents we ask for will depend on "
"the size and nature of your business. However, we will likely need you to"
" confirm your business legal entity structure, list of beneficial owners,"
" and the countries or territories you do business in."
msgstr "商業客戶須視乎業務規模及性質提供相關資料。在一般情況下，我們或許需要客戶提供資料確認業務法定架構、實益擁有人、以及與公司有業務往來的國家或地區。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4645 HSBC Let's Safeguard_ _ and crime fight financial fraud
#: frontend/templates/HSBC security
msgid ""
"We understand your concerns, and we want to let you know that information"
" being requested will be used to ensure we understand our customers. We "
"aim to take the lead when it comes to adopting high standards to "
"safeguard the financial system. Having the right information is a key "
"part of detecting and deterring financial crime."
msgstr "我們明白你的顧慮，同時希望你理解所需資料會用作確保我們對客戶的認知。我們將確保金融系統以及你的資料備受最高級別的安全標準所保障，而取得準確無誤的資料是讓我們能偵測和防止金融罪案發生的重要一環。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4655 HSBC Let's Safeguard_ _ and crime fight financial fraud
#: frontend/templates/HSBC security
msgid ""
"You will receive follow-up reminders from us. If you are having trouble "
"gathering the information, please do let us know as soon as possible so "
"that we can help wherever possible. It may, for example, be possible for "
"us to rely on alternative documents in your possession. If we cannot "
"obtain a sufficient level of information about your account, it may "
"impact the services that we are able to provide you until we can update "
"your account details. Please let us know if you need more time or if you "
"have any further questions."
msgstr "我們會提示你並與你跟進。如你於收集資料時遇上困難，請盡快通知我們，讓我們為你提供相應協助。例如：我們或許可以接納你手上其他文件以作替代。若我們不能得到有關你戶口的足夠資料，所提供的銀行服務或會受到影響，直到你的戶口資料更新為止。如你需要更多時間作準備，或有任何疑問，請與我們聯絡。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4665 HSBC Let's Safeguard_ _ and crime fight financial fraud
#: frontend/templates/HSBC security
msgid ""
"We may need to request information from you as a new customer as well, "
"because we need to understand each of the relationships we build. "
"However, we will try to keep the process as simple and straightforward as"
" possible so as to minimise the impact on you. The information we have "
"about you will be kept confidential and that will help us protect your "
"account from potential misuse."
msgstr "我們希望深入認識每一位新客戶，所以需要更詳盡的客戶資料。然而，我們將會以最簡單及直接的方式完成整個程序，以減低對你的影響。你所提供的資料將會保密，亦可助我們保障你的戶口免受潛在的金融罪案所影響。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4683 HSBC Let's Safeguard_ _ and crime fight financial fraud
#: frontend/templates/HSBC security
#, fuzzy
msgid "Data and security"
msgstr "資料及保安&nbsp;"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4702 HSBC Let's Safeguard_ _ and crime fight financial fraud
#: frontend/templates/HSBC security
msgid ""
"As more and more of our customers live, travel and trade internationally,"
" we are always looking for better ways to give you greater peace of mind,"
" whatever you do. Our global systems and processes work by sharing data "
"and customer information across borders in order to deter and detect "
"financial crime. Even when you only bank in one country or territory, we "
"are committed to protecting the integrity of the financial system as "
"financial crime is a global operation."
msgstr "隨著客戶於生活、旅遊及商務越趨國際化，我們致力為客戶提供更佳的銀行服務及保障，讓你無論身處世界任何地方，亦可更安心地追求所想。我們的環球系統及程序透過跨境的數據及客戶資料，以偵測及阻止金融罪案。即使你只是身處其中一個國家或地區享用銀行服務，我們亦致力保障健全的金融體系，免受國際金融罪案影響。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4705 HSBC Let's Safeguard_ _ and crime fight financial fraud
#: frontend/templates/HSBC security
msgid ""
"By confirming your details and making sure that all the information we "
"hold about you is up to date, you will help us make banking more secure "
"for yourself and other customers."
msgstr "透過核實及更新你存於本行的資料，可協助我們為你及其他客戶提供更安全的理財服務。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:2349 HK.html:4738 HSBC Let's Safeguard_ _ and card credit
#: crime fight financial fraud frontend/templates/HSBC
#: frontend/templates/Preventing security
msgid "Remarks"
msgstr "註"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4752 HSBC Let's Safeguard_ _ and crime fight financial fraud
#: frontend/templates/HSBC security
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Apple, the Apple logo, iPhone, Touch ID and Face ID are trademarks of "
"Apple Inc., registered or in the process of being registered in the US "
"and other countries/territories.  Android is a trademark of Google LLC."
msgstr ""
"Apple、Apple標誌、iPhone、Touch ID及Face ID均為Apple "
"Inc.在美國及其他國家/地區註冊或現正註冊中的商標。Android是Google LLC的商標。"

#: - And Avoid HK.html:9 HSBC How Investment Scams Them To Work
#: frontend/templates/How
msgid "How Investment Scams Work And How To Avoid Them - HSBC HK"
msgstr "投資騙案手法及防騙貼士 | 香港投資詐騙 - 香港滙豐"

#: - And Avoid HK.html:4410 HSBC How Investment Scams Them To Work
#: frontend/templates/How
msgid ""
"Are you looking for low-risk, high-return investments that can make a "
"profit quickly? Beware of falling victim to investment scams!"
msgstr "想找可以短時間獲利又低風險高回報的投資？小心上當成為投資騙案的受害者！"

#: - And Avoid HK.html:4416 HSBC How Investment Scams Them To Work
#: frontend/templates/How
msgid ""
"<table>\n"
"<tbody>\n"
"<tr>\n"
"<td>\n"
"                                                        What are "
"investment scams?\n"
"                                                    </td>\n"
"</tr>\n"
"</tbody>\n"
"</table>"
msgstr ""

#: - And Avoid HK.html:4430 HSBC How Investment Scams Them To Work
#: frontend/templates/How
msgid ""
"Investment scams are designed to deceive individuals into investing money"
" in fake opportunities, such as cryptocurrencies and A-shares trading "
"that don't exist."
msgstr "在投資騙案中，騙徒會以虛假的投資機會誘使受害人付出真金白銀，如投資於不存在的虛擬貨幣、A股交易等。"

#: - And Avoid HK.html:4433 HSBC How Investment Scams Them To Work
#: frontend/templates/How
msgid ""
"There are various types of investment fraud. They often result in "
"significant financial loss, theft of sensitive personal information, or "
"unauthorised access to online banking."
msgstr "投資騙案手法層出不窮，而這種騙案多數會引致重大財務損失、敏感個人資料被盜，或未經授權的網上理財交易。"

#: - And Avoid HK.html:4440 HSBC How Investment Scams Them To Work
#: frontend/templates/How
msgid "Different kinds of investment scams"
msgstr "不同種類的投資騙案"

#: - And Avoid HK.html:4447 HSBC How Investment Scams Them To Work
#: frontend/templates/How
msgid "Unsolicited offers"
msgstr "不請自來的投資機會"

#: - And Avoid HK.html:4454 HSBC How Investment Scams Them To Work
#: frontend/templates/How
msgid ""
"Scammers may pretend to be celebrities on social media or in chat groups,"
" including Instagram, Facebook, WhatsApp, Tinder and Telegram. They share"
" fake insider tips or develop an online romantic relationship with the "
"victims to lure them into opening accounts and transferring funds on fake"
" investment platforms."
msgstr "騙徒會在Instagram、Facebook、WhatsApp、Tinder、Telegram等社交媒體或通訊群組假扮成名人，發放虛假內幕投資消息，或與受害人發展網上情緣，以誘使受害人於虛假投資平台開設戶口，並投入資金。"

#: - And Avoid HK.html:4461 HSBC How Investment Scams Them To Work
#: frontend/templates/How
msgid "Fake websites and portfolios"
msgstr "虛假網站及投資組合"

#: - And Avoid HK.html:4468 HSBC How Investment Scams Them To Work
#: frontend/templates/How
msgid ""
"Fraudsters set up fraudulent websites and portfolios that look genuine to"
" promote fake investments with unrealistically high returns."
msgstr "騙徒會建立極度像真的虛假網站和投資組合，宣傳異常高回報的虛假投資計劃。"

#: - And Avoid HK.html:4475 HSBC How Investment Scams Them To Work
#: frontend/templates/How
msgid "Bank employee impersonation"
msgstr "假冒銀行職員"

#: - And Avoid HK.html:4482 HSBC How Investment Scams Them To Work
#: frontend/templates/How
msgid ""
"Scammers may pretend to be bank employees and offer fake investment "
"opportunities. They may also claim that an account is frozen and under "
"investigation, urging victims to transfer money to a specific account."
msgstr "騙徒會假扮成銀行職員去提供虛假投資機會，亦會向受害人訛稱戶口被凍結以進行調查，迫使受害人轉賬到其他特定戶口。"

#: - And Avoid HK.html:4489 HSBC How Investment Scams Them To Work
#: frontend/templates/How
msgid "Monetary inducement"
msgstr "金錢利誘"

#: - And Avoid HK.html:4496 HSBC How Investment Scams Them To Work
#: frontend/templates/How
msgid ""
"Fraudster may pay victims a small amount of returns to build trust and "
"encourage them to further invest. But in the end, victims are unable to "
"withdraw any money and suffer financial loss."
msgstr "騙徒會向受害人支付少量的投資回報來建立信心，鼓勵受害人繼續投資。不過，受害人到最後會無法提取任何資金，遭受財務損失。"

#: - And Avoid HK.html:4503 HSBC How Investment Scams Them To Work
#: frontend/templates/How
msgid ""
"Apart from the above, fraudsters may also steal sensitive personal "
"information. They may even remotely control bank accounts using fake "
"investment apps that contain malware to conduct unauthorised "
"transactions."
msgstr "除了以上手法，騙徒也有可能盜取敏感個人資料，或以含有惡意軟件的虛假投資應用程式遙距控制受害人的銀行戶口，進行未經授權的交易。"

#: - And Avoid HK.html:4510 HSBC How Investment Scams Them To Work
#: frontend/templates/How
msgid "Spotting red flags of investment scams"
msgstr "投資騙案特點"

#: - And Avoid HK.html:4522 HSBC How Investment Scams Them To Work
#: frontend/templates/How
msgid "Too good to be true"
msgstr "過份吸引的投資機會"

#: - And Avoid HK.html:4525 HSBC How Investment Scams Them To Work
#: frontend/templates/How
msgid ""
"Being offered low-risk, high-return investment opportunities that seem "
"great but can't possibly be real."
msgstr "遇到低風險高回報，但並不符合現實的投資機會。"

#: - And Avoid HK.html:4530 HSBC How Investment Scams Them To Work
#: frontend/templates/How
msgid "Pressure tactics"
msgstr "不斷游說施壓"

#: - And Avoid HK.html:4533 HSBC How Investment Scams Them To Work
#: frontend/templates/How
msgid ""
"Scammers often create a sense of urgency, pressuring victims to invest "
"quickly without giving them time to research or think carefully."
msgstr "徒通常會向受害人施壓要即時作出投資決定，令受害人沒有時間做資料搜集，甚至無法仔細考慮。"

#: - And Avoid HK.html:4538 HSBC How Investment Scams Them To Work
#: frontend/templates/How
msgid "Suspicious transfer requests"
msgstr "可疑的轉賬指示"

#: - And Avoid HK.html:4541 HSBC How Investment Scams Them To Work
#: frontend/templates/How
msgid "Being asked to transfer money to an unknown third-party account."
msgstr "要求受害人轉賬至不明的第三方戶口。"

#: - And Avoid HK.html:4546 HSBC How Investment Scams Them To Work
#: frontend/templates/How
msgid "Withdrawal issues"
msgstr "難以提款"

#: - And Avoid HK.html:4549 HSBC How Investment Scams Them To Work
#: frontend/templates/How
msgid ""
"When victims make a profit and ask to withdraw money, the administrator "
"of the fake platform will make up excuses, like claiming that the account"
" is frozen or asking for extra charges to process the withdrawal."
msgstr "當受害人的投資有進帳，想從投資戶口提取資金時，虛假平台的管理人會諸多推搪，以戶口被凍結、提款須付額外手續費等為理由阻撓受害人提款。"

#: - And Avoid HK.html:4559 HSBC How Investment Scams Them To Work
#: frontend/templates/How
msgid "How to prevent investment scams"
msgstr "如何提防投資騙案"

#: - And Avoid HK.html:4571 HSBC How Investment Scams Them To Work
#: frontend/templates/How
msgid ""
"Carry out thorough background checks on investment referrers, the "
"products, and investment platforms. Verify their claims and identities "
"through official channels."
msgstr "仔細查清楚投資推薦人、投資產品和投資平台的背景，透過官方渠道核實消息和身分。"

#: - And Avoid HK.html:4576 HSBC How Investment Scams Them To Work
#: frontend/templates/How
msgid ""
"Consult chartered professionals and refer to the Securities and Futures "
"Commission (SFC) website for a list of licensed or suspicious virtual "
"asset trading platforms."
msgstr "諮詢合資格的專業人士，並參閱證券及期貨事務監察委員會（證監會）網站，查看持牌或可疑的虛擬資產交易平台名單。"

#: - And Avoid HK.html:4581 HSBC How Investment Scams Them To Work
#: frontend/templates/How
msgid ""
"Never allow anyone else to set up an investment account, upload ID "
"documents, or manage investments on your behalf."
msgstr "不要托任何人幫您開立投資戶口、上載身分證明文件，或代為管理投資。"

#: - And Avoid HK.html:4586 HSBC How Investment Scams Them To Work
#: frontend/templates/How
msgid ""
"Avoid disclosing sensitive personal information or downloading apps that "
"may contain malware. Fraudsters can use them to access your devices and "
"transfer money without your knowledge."
msgstr "避免透露敏感個人資料，或下載可能含有惡意軟件的應用程式，因為騙徒可以利用這類應用程式在您不知情的情況下盜用您的流動裝置轉移資金。"

#: - And Avoid HK.html:4591 HSBC How Investment Scams Them To Work
#: frontend/templates/How
msgid ""
"Be cautious if you're asked to transfer money and mislead your bank about"
" the reason for the payment. Fraudsters use such tactics to avoid "
"scrutiny."
msgstr "如果有人要求您轉賬並向銀行提出不實的轉賬原因，一定要加以留神，因為這是騙徒避過審查的一種手法。"

#: - And Avoid HK.html:4596 HSBC How Investment Scams Them To Work
#: frontend/templates/How
msgid ""
"Never transfer money to an unknown account. Use the Hong Kong Police "
"Force's Scameter or Scameter+ app to check suspicious phone numbers, "
"URLs, or receiving accounts."
msgstr "不要轉賬至不明戶口，應使用香港警方的「防騙視伏器」或「防騙視伏App」應用程式評估可疑電話號碼、網頁、收賬戶口等的風險。"

#: - And Avoid HK.html:4606 HSBC How Investment Scams Them To Work
#: frontend/templates/How
msgid ""
"HSBC is committed to protecting your financial security. Think you might "
"have come across investment scams? Please contact us at:"
msgstr "滙豐致力保障您的財務安全。懷疑自己遭遇投資騙案？請即聯絡我們："

#: - And Avoid Aware HK.html:4857 HK.html:4895 HSBC How Instagram Investment Of
#: Scams Them To WhatsApp Work frontend/templates/How frontend/templates/Stay
msgid ""
"Did you know that some scammers temporarily inflate your ledger balance "
"to cheat you out of goods or money?"
msgstr "騙徒會設法令您戶口的賬面結餘暫時增加，騙取貨物和金錢！"

#: - And Avoid Cyber Fraud HK.html:9 HSBC Job Scams Security To _
#: frontend/templates/How
msgid "How To Avoid Job Scams | Cyber Security And Fraud - HSBC HK"
msgstr "求職騙案 | 網絡安全及防詐騙資訊中心 - 香港滙豐"

#: - And Avoid Cyber Fraud HK.html:4373 HSBC Job Scams Security To _
#: frontend/templates/How
msgid ""
"Are you fresh out of school and keen to enter the workforce? Or are you "
"eager to look for the next best opportunity or a better paying job?"
msgstr "剛畢業投入職場？還是想轉工更上一層樓？"

#: - And Avoid Cyber Fraud HK.html:4380 HSBC Job Scams Security To _
#: frontend/templates/How
msgid ""
"It might be tempting to see job ads that promise a big pay raise, great "
"benefits and short hours. But if a career opportunity sounds too good to "
"be true, it probably is."
msgstr "看見薪高糧準、工時短、福利多的工作難免令人心動，但如果這份工真的好到難以置信，其實很有可能是求職騙案。"

#: - And Avoid Cyber Fraud HK.html:4383 HSBC Job Scams Security To _
#: frontend/templates/How
msgid "One day, you log on to social media and this job ad pops up:"
msgstr "打開社交網站，您看到這樣的招聘廣告："

#: - And Avoid Cyber Fraud HK.html:4391 HSBC Job Scams Security To _
#: frontend/templates/How
msgid ""
"Want to make money quickly and easily? We're hiring people to help with "
"money transfers. No experience or qualifications required. All you have "
"to do is send us a copy of your HKID card and proof of income to apply. "
"Limited openings. Call us now!"
msgstr "招請員工協助匯款，毋須學歷經驗，輕鬆月入數萬。申請時須提交收入證明及身分證副本。招請名額有限，馬上致電申請。"

#: - And Avoid Cyber Fraud HK.html:4399 HSBC Job Scams Security To _
#: frontend/templates/How
msgid ""
"Making money quickly and easily sounds a bit too good to be true, but "
"they're hiring just a few people. You don't want to miss out on a golden "
"opportunity. It won't hurt to call and ask for details, will it? So you "
"make the call."
msgstr "輕輕鬆鬆就月入數萬？您有點懷疑，但「荀工」可能轉瞬即逝，於是您決定打電話去問問詳情。"

#: - And Avoid Cyber Fraud HK.html:4402 HSBC Job Scams Security To _
#: frontend/templates/How
msgid ""
"\"It's an easy job. We just need to borrow your bank account to make some"
" money transfers. We'll deposit some money into your account, and once "
"you've wired the money to our account overseas, you'll receive a "
"commission. All we need is a copy of your HKID card, proof of your "
"income, proof of your address and some cash upfront to make sure you "
"won't run away once you've received the money for the transfers. It's "
"just a precaution.\""
msgstr "「我們的工作很簡單。我們會借用您的戶口匯款，您再將錢轉去別的戶口就可以賺佣。您只需要提交收入證明、住址證明和身分證副本，還要支付保證金，免得您收到匯款後失去聯絡。」"

#: - And Avoid Cyber Fraud HK.html:4405 HSBC Job Scams Security To _
#: frontend/templates/How
msgid ""
"You think to yourself, \"They're transferring money into my account, so "
"of course they'll need my personal details and a cash deposit. That "
"sounds fair.\""
msgstr "您想：「要將錢匯到我的戶口，需要提供一些個人資料和保證金，也很合理。」"

#: - And Avoid Cyber Fraud HK.html:4408 HSBC Job Scams Security To _
#: frontend/templates/How
msgid ""
"So you take a picture of your HKID card, pay statement and proof of "
"address, and use your mobile payment app to transfer a deposit to your "
"'future boss'. You hope you can start this project soon as it'll bring in"
" extra money without having to work hard. It's really easy!"
msgstr "於是您用手機拍下收入證明、住址證明和身分證等文件，然後打開電子支付程式，準備將保證金轉賬給您的「未來僱主」，滿心期望不用花太多力氣就可以賺錢，真好﹗"

#: - And Avoid Cyber Fraud HK.html:4415 HSBC Job Scams Security To _
#: frontend/templates/How
msgid "Wait just a second – does it sound too perfect?"
msgstr "停一停，勿上當"

#: - And Avoid Cyber Fraud HK.html:4422 HSBC Job Scams Security To _
#: frontend/templates/How
msgid ""
"Slow down and think. Have you ever wondered why your 'new boss' needs to "
"borrow your bank account for transfers? Why does the company need you to "
"give them copies of your pay statement, proof of address and HKID card at"
" such an early stage? And why do you have to pay them before you start "
"work?"
msgstr "慢著，先別急著開始投入「新工作」。您有沒有想過為甚麼「未來老闆」要借用您的戶口？為甚麼一開始就要您交出收入證明、住址證明和身分證副本？為甚麼上班前要先付錢？"

#: - And Avoid Cyber Fraud HK.html:4425 HSBC Job Scams Security To _
#: frontend/templates/How
msgid ""
"The truth is: you thought you found the perfect job, but it was actually "
"a scam."
msgstr "您以為自己好運遇上「絕世筍工」，其實只是一頭栽進騙案之中。"

#: - And Avoid Cyber Fraud HK.html:4428 HSBC Job Scams Security To _
#: frontend/templates/How
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\"They can't scam me if I don't pay them anything.\" Unfortunately, this "
"isn't true. Giving out your personal information will already make you "
"more likely to lose money. Fraudsters only need your online banking "
"credentials, a recent headshot, one-time-passwords (OTPs), your date of "
"birth and HKID number to complete a transaction or make a transfer in "
"your name."
msgstr "您以為不付錢就沒事？隨便提供個人資料，同樣會令您被騙的機會大增！騙徒只要掌握您的銀行登入資料、近照、一次性密碼（OTP）、出生日期和身分證號碼，就可以冒用您的名義進行交易或轉賬。"

#: - And Avoid Cyber Fraud HK.html:4431 HSBC Job Scams Security To _
#: frontend/templates/How
msgid ""
"In fact, all that's needed to get a loan from a bank is a copy of your "
"HKID card, pay statement and proof of your home address. A scammer can "
"easily apply to borrow money and leave you responsible for their debt."
msgstr "他們更可以用您的收入證明、住址證明和身分證副本向銀行貸款，要您幫他們還錢。"

#: - And Avoid Cyber Fraud HK.html:4438 HSBC Job Scams Security To _
#: frontend/templates/How
msgid "Tips to protect you from job scams"
msgstr "防範求職騙案貼士"

#: - And Avoid Cyber Fraud HK.html:4445 HSBC Job Scams Security To _
#: frontend/templates/How
msgid ""
"Even if you're digitally savvy, you shouldn't underestimate the damage "
"fake online job offers could cause. Follow these tips to keep your "
"personal data safe from career scams."
msgstr "即使您經常使用數碼科技，也不要以為自己一定不會上當。記得做足以下措施，謹慎分享個人資料："

#: - And Avoid Cyber Fraud HK.html:4457 HSBC Job Scams Security To _
#: frontend/templates/How
msgid "Don't give away too much information in job applications"
msgstr "申請工作時，切勿提供過多個人資料"

#: - And Avoid Cyber Fraud HK.html:4460 HSBC Job Scams Security To _
#: frontend/templates/How
msgid ""
"Details you shouldn't provide right at the beginning of a job application"
" include proof of your home address and a copy of your HKID card. These "
"details could be asked for later during a background check by a "
"legitimate company. If you're asked to provide them at the start, that's "
"a big red flag."
msgstr "申請工作時，不要一開始就提供住址證明及身分證副本等資料。正規的公司決定聘請您後，可能會要求您提供這些資料作背景審查，但如果有公司要您在申請工作時就向他們提供個人資料，一定要小心提防。"

#: - And Avoid Cyber Fraud HK.html:4465 HSBC Job Scams Security To _
#: frontend/templates/How
msgid "Don't reveal sensitive information"
msgstr "切勿提供敏感資料"

#: - And Avoid Cyber Fraud HK.html:4468 HSBC Job Scams Security To _
#: frontend/templates/How
msgid ""
"Never give away information such as your online banking credentials and "
"one-time passwords (OTPs)."
msgstr "千萬不要透露銀行登入資料及一次性密碼（OTP）。"

#: - And Avoid Cyber Fraud HK.html:4473 HSBC Job Scams Security To _
#: frontend/templates/How
msgid "Check if the job opening is authentic"
msgstr "查探空缺真偽"

#: - And Avoid Cyber Fraud HK.html:4476 HSBC Job Scams Security To _
#: frontend/templates/How
msgid ""
"Search for the phone number listed in the job ad on the web, and even "
"call it to check if it's linked to a reliable organisation."
msgstr "搜尋招聘廣告的電話號碼，甚至致電去查證號碼是否來自合法的公司。"

#: - And Avoid Cyber Fraud HK.html:4481 HSBC Job Scams Security To _
#: frontend/templates/How
msgid "Do a thorough check on the people you're speaking with"
msgstr "了解和您對話的「公司員工」"

#: - And Avoid Cyber Fraud HK.html:4484 HSBC Job Scams Security To _
#: frontend/templates/How
msgid ""
"Even if you do reach someone on the phone who seems to have legitimate "
"information about the company, be sure to stay wary. This is because "
"fraudsters could be using a bogus number to make their scam more "
"convincing. For instance, check if they have a LinkedIn profile with a "
"photograph, and if their past work experience matches the title they "
"claim to currently hold."
msgstr "騙徒擅長在電話上假冒身分，所以即使他們侃侃而談，向您介紹「公司」背景，也要記得查探他們的身分。您可以搜尋他們有沒有LinkedIn個人檔案、上面有沒有相片，看看他們的工作經驗和職位是否吻合。"

#: - And Avoid Cyber Fraud HK.html:4489 HSBC Job Scams Security To _
#: frontend/templates/How
msgid "Do your own research on the company"
msgstr "事先了解公司資料"

#: - And Avoid Cyber Fraud HK.html:4492 HSBC Job Scams Security To _
#: frontend/templates/How
msgid ""
"Look for the firm's background information, its scale of operation and "
"its address."
msgstr "例如公司背景、規模及地址。"

#: - And Avoid Cyber Fraud HK.html:4497 HSBC Job Scams Security To _
#: frontend/templates/How
msgid "Don't pay to work"
msgstr "不要預繳費用"

#: - And Avoid Cyber Fraud HK.html:4500 HSBC Job Scams Security To _
#: frontend/templates/How
msgid ""
"When applying for jobs, don't pay any fees upfront to the company or "
"related parties."
msgstr "申請工作時，不要付給對方任何費用。"

#: - And Avoid Cyber Fraud HK.html:4510 HSBC Job Scams Security To _
#: frontend/templates/How
msgid ""
"Remember, there's nothing wrong with being eager to find a new job or get"
" a higher salary. Just be aware that this could make you more vulnerable "
"to job scams."
msgstr "緊記不要因為心急求職，而誤墮騙局。"

#: - Be Cyber Fraud HK.html:9 HSBC Security Smart_ _ and frontend/templates/How
#: to
msgid "How to Be Cyber Smart? | Cyber Security and Fraud - HSBC HK"
msgstr "如何變得更Cyber Smart？ | 網絡安全及防詐騙資訊中心 - 香港滙豐"

#: - Be Cyber Fraud HK.html:4333 HSBC Security Smart_ _ and
#: frontend/templates/How to
#, fuzzy, python-format
msgid ""
"Only 8.5% of Hongkongers earned a Cyber Smart ranking in our survey. What"
" were their biggest mistakes? Let's find out."
msgstr "我們的調查結果發現，只有8.5%%香港人能達到Cyber Smart等級。到底他們最常犯的錯誤是甚麼？讓我們來一探究竟。"

#: - Be Cyber Fraud HK.html:4392 HSBC Security Smart_ _ and
#: frontend/templates/How to
msgid "How to be Cyber Smart?"
msgstr "如何變得更Cyber Smart？"

#: - Be Cyber Fraud HK.html:4415 HSBC Security Smart_ _ and
#: frontend/templates/How to
msgid ""
"The internet has made our lives incredibly convenient. But for all the "
"benefits this enormous data explosion gives us, it also brings new risks."
msgstr "互聯網帶來的數據大爆炸，雖然讓我們的生活更加方便，但也為我們帶來新的風險。"

#: - Be Cyber Fraud HK.html:4418 HSBC Security Smart_ _ and
#: frontend/templates/How to
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Are Hongkongers able handle and avoid threats like identity theft, online"
" scams, account hacks or ransomware?"
msgstr "對於互聯網帶來的身份盜竊、網上詐騙、賬戶被盜或電腦勒索等危機，港人有能力處理和防範嗎？"

#: - Be Cyber Fraud HK.html:4422 HSBC Security Smart_ _ and
#: frontend/templates/How to
msgid ""
"We wanted to know. So in February 2020, we surveyed more than 1,000 Hong "
"Kong residents – both HSBC customers and non-customers – to see how "
"\"Cyber Smart\" they are."
msgstr "我們很好奇，所以我們在2020年2月進行調查，訪問超過1,000名香港居民（包括滙豐和非滙豐客戶），了解他們有多「Cyber Smart」。"

#: - Be Cyber Fraud HK.html:4426 HSBC Security Smart_ _ and
#: frontend/templates/How to
msgid ""
"We plotted their results on our Cyber Security Index, which we developed "
"with a well-known market research company."
msgstr "我們又與一家知名市場調研公司合作開發網絡安全指數，顯示調查結果。"

#: - Be Cyber Fraud HK.html:4452 HSBC Security Smart_ _ and
#: frontend/templates/How to
msgid "The Index is comprised of 3 key pillars:"
msgstr "網絡安全指數由三大關鍵指標組成："

#: - Be Cyber Fraud HK.html:4485 HSBC Security Smart_ _ and
#: frontend/templates/How to
msgid "Let's look at the results."
msgstr "現在，來了解一下調查結果吧。"

#: - Be Cyber Fraud HK.html:4516 HSBC Security Smart_ _ and
#: frontend/templates/How to
msgid "What it takes to be \"Cyber Smart\""
msgstr "怎樣才算「Cyber Smart」"

#: - Be Cyber Fraud HK.html:4523 HSBC Security Smart_ _ and
#: frontend/templates/How to
msgid ""
"To get a Cyber Smart rating, respondents had to score 80 or above in all "
"three sections of the survey. These scores show that they are more "
"conscious of different online scams and are willing to learn more about "
"the latest cybersecurity tips. They take more preventive measures against"
" cyber attacks, as well as try their best to avoid potentially risky "
"behaviours."
msgstr ""
"受訪者必須在全部三個範疇中取得80分或以上，才可以達到「Cyber "
"Smart」等級。這個等級代表他們對各種網上詐騙較為警惕，亦願意了解更多最新的網絡安全秘訣，同時會對網絡攻擊採取更多防範措施，盡力避免做出可能會對安全構成風險的行為。"

#: - Be Cyber Fraud HK.html:4526 HSBC Security Smart_ _ and
#: frontend/templates/How to
#, fuzzy, python-format
msgid ""
"Only 8.5% of the people in our survey received a Cyber Smart rating. What"
" did most of them get wrong? How could they have done better?"
msgstr "但是，只有8.5%%的受訪者可以歸為「Cyber Smart」。到底香港人最常犯的錯誤是甚麼？他們有甚麼可以改善的地方？"

#: - Be Cyber Fraud HK.html:4530 HSBC Security Smart_ _ and
#: frontend/templates/How to
#, fuzzy
msgid "Here are some of the most common mistakes:"
msgstr "來看一下他們最常犯的錯誤："

#: - Be Cyber Fraud HK.html:4580 HSBC Security Smart_ _ and
#: frontend/templates/How to
msgid "Cyber Smart tips to remember your password:"
msgstr "記住密碼的小秘訣："

#: - Be Cyber Fraud HK.html:4594 HSBC Security Smart_ _ and
#: frontend/templates/How to
msgid "Using your password on a regular basis will help you remember it."
msgstr "定期輸入密碼，可以幫您將它牢牢記住。"

#: - Be Cyber Fraud HK.html:4610 HSBC Security Smart_ _ and
#: frontend/templates/How to
msgid ""
"Use a combination of letters (upper &amp; lower case), numbers and "
"symbols. It will look like gibberish, but it can still have a special "
"meaning for you so you can easily remember it."
msgstr "使用結合大小寫字母、數字和符號的密碼可能令其他人摸不著頭腦，但對您可以包含特別意思，幫您更易記住。"

#: - Be Cyber Fraud HK.html:4625 HSBC Security Smart_ _ and
#: frontend/templates/How to
msgid ""
"The HSBC HK Mobile Banking app lets you log on with just a smile or a "
"touch. It's hard to forget your face or your fingerprint."
msgstr "只需簡單一按，或者一個笑容，即可輕鬆登入香港滙豐流動理財應用程式。用臉部和指紋登入，就不用苦記密碼了吧？"

#: - Be Cyber Fraud HK.html:4806 HSBC Security Smart_ _ and
#: frontend/templates/How to
msgid ""
"We are very proud that the survey results ranked us as Hong Kong's most "
"trusted bank"
msgstr ""

#: - Be Cyber Fraud HK.html:4813 HSBC Security Smart_ _ and
#: frontend/templates/How to
msgid ""
"But we can't do it without your help. Updating your unique online banking"
" password is a great start. Ensuring that all of your personal "
"information with us is up to date is another simple but powerful tool in "
"the fight against cybercrime."
msgstr "不過，如果沒有您的配合，我們就無法成功。您可以先為網上理財設置獨特的新密碼，並向我們提供最新的個人資料，踏出網絡安全的第一步。不要少看這個步驟，它看似簡單，卻能有效防範網絡犯罪。"

#: - Be Cyber Fraud HK.html:4816 HSBC Security Smart_ _ and
#: frontend/templates/How to
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"We'll be updating our Cyber Security Index every year. We hope that "
"articles like this, as well as our"
msgstr "我們每年都會更新網絡安全指數，希望這篇文章和其他"

#: - Be Cyber Fraud HK.html:4816 HSBC Security Smart_ _ and
#: frontend/templates/How to
msgid "other cyber security tips"
msgstr "網絡安全錦囊"

#: - Be Cyber Fraud HK.html:4838 HSBC Security Smart_ _ and
#: frontend/templates/How to
#, fuzzy
msgid "Statistics from HSBC Cyber Security Index 2020"
msgstr "數據來自滙豐網絡安全調查2020"

#: - ATM Cyber HK.html:9 HSBC _ and avoid fraud frontend/templates/How security
#: to traps
msgid "How to avoid ATM traps | Cyber security and fraud - HSBC HK"
msgstr "自動櫃員機有甚麼陷阱？ | 網絡安全及防詐騙資訊 - 香港滙豐"

#: - ATM Cyber HK.html:4334 HSBC _ and avoid fraud frontend/templates/How
#: security to traps
msgid "Protect yourself from common threats at the ATM"
msgstr "保護自己，提防常見的自動櫃員機陷阱"

#: - ATM Cyber HK.html:4416 HSBC _ and avoid fraud frontend/templates/How
#: security to traps
msgid ""
"Most of us use ATMs on a regular basis. But just because you’re familiar "
"with the machines doesn’t mean you should let your guard down. Take a "
"look at some of the ways criminals have used them to steal people’s "
"personal banking details."
msgstr "大部分人都經常使用自動櫃員機，但即使熟悉操作，亦不代表應放低戒備。不法分子會以各種方式盜取個人戶口資料，以下略舉數例。"

#: - ATM Cyber HK.html:4437 HSBC _ and avoid fraud frontend/templates/How
#: security to traps
msgid ""
"Criminals have been known to attach card readers to the card slots on an "
"ATM. When an unsuspecting customer inserts their card into the ATM, the "
"card reader will copy all the account information associated with that "
"card."
msgstr "某些匪徒會在自動櫃員機的卡槽裝上讀卡器。如客戶並無防備而把卡插入櫃員機，讀卡器便會複製與該卡相關的所有戶口資料。"

#: - ATM Cyber HK.html:4449 HSBC _ and avoid fraud frontend/templates/How
#: security to traps
msgid "It’s not always so high tech."
msgstr "匪徒絕非全靠高科技作案，"

#: - ATM Cyber HK.html:4482 HSBC _ and avoid fraud frontend/templates/How
#: security to traps
msgid "What you can do"
msgstr "防範措施"

#: - ATM Cyber HK.html:4504 HSBC _ and avoid fraud frontend/templates/How
#: security to traps
msgid "Smart Tips"
msgstr "保安錦囊"

#: - Cyber HK.html:9 HSBC _ and bogus calls fraud frontend/templates/How
#: identify security to
msgid "How to identify bogus calls | Cyber security and fraud - HSBC HK"
msgstr "如何分辨假冒來電？ | 網絡安全及防詐騙資訊 - 香港滙豐"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4332 HSBC _ and bogus calls fraud frontend/templates/How
#: identify security to
msgid "How to avoid being a victim of telephone fraudsters"
msgstr "如何避免成為電話騙案的受害人"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4414 HSBC _ and bogus calls fraud frontend/templates/How
#: identify security to
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A caller may claim to be from HSBC or another financial institution and "
"could for instance, invite you to apply for a personal loan or a credit "
"card. Any time you receive a call claiming to be from a well-known "
"financial institution, always try to authenticate it. Try to get more "
"information from the caller: ask for their department name and office "
"number as well as how they got your phone number and account information."
" If they are unwilling to share this information, do not continue the "
"conversation. You can also call the HSBC hotline to verify the identity "
"of the caller."
msgstr "來電者可能自稱是滙豐或其他金融機構的職員，並可能會邀請您申請私人貸款或信用卡。如接到報稱來自知名金融機構的來電，務必加以核實。應嘗試向來電者索取更多資料：詢問他們所屬部門的名稱及辦公室電話號碼，以及他們是如何取得您的電話號碼和戶口資料。若他們不願意透露，便應終止對話。您亦可致電滙豐熱線電話以核實來電者的身份。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4418 HSBC _ and bogus calls fraud frontend/templates/How
#: identify security to
msgid ""
"Never disclose any sensitive personal information to the caller. HSBC "
"will never phone you or email you asking sensitive personal information."
msgstr "在任何情況下，都不應向來電者披露敏感個人資料。滙豐絕不會以電話或電郵方式向您索取任何敏感個人資料。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4426 HSBC _ and bogus calls fraud frontend/templates/How
#: identify security to
msgid "Tips to help you identify a fraudulent call"
msgstr "有欺詐成份的來電的識別指引"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4482 HSBC _ and bogus calls fraud frontend/templates/How
#: identify security to
msgid "What you can do if you receive a suspicious call"
msgstr "接到可疑來電後應怎辦？"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4488 HSBC _ and bogus calls fraud frontend/templates/How
#: identify security to
msgid ""
"If you receive a suspicious call, don’t be alarmed. Hang up immediately. "
"Call us at"
msgstr "如接到可疑來電，切勿驚慌失措，並應即時掛斷電話。若您曾向來電者透露任何個人資料，請致電"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4492 HSBC _ and bogus calls fraud frontend/templates/How
#: identify security to
msgid ""
"Should you receive a call from someone at HSBC that causes you concern "
"over their identity, be aware that actual HSBC employees will be able to "
"inform you of their name and the relevant branch/department they belong "
"to. You can then verify the employee's identity by calling our hotline. "
"Our staff will never ask you to provide sensitive personal information, "
"such as passwords, over the phone, nor will we notify you of account "
"irregularities using pre-recorded messages. If you're suspicious of any "
"calls claiming to be from HSBC, do not disclose your personal or account "
"information, and contact us at once."
msgstr "若您接收到宣稱為滙豐的來電而您亦對對方的身份有懷疑，請緊記真正的滙豐員工可以清楚地提供其員工名稱、所屬分行或部門等資料，您可以致電我們的熱線電話以確認其身份。我們的員工不會透過電話向您索取敏感的個人資料如保安密碼，滙豐亦不會以錄音訊息告知賬戶的異常情況。如您對自稱為滙豐職員的來電感到懷疑，切忌提供任何個人資料或賬戶資訊，並請立即致電滙豐。"

