#: - Cyber HK.html:4726 HSBC _ and fraud frontend/templates/How report security
#: to
msgid ""
"What to do if you get an SMS alert from HSBC - and how to tell if it's "
"genuine"
msgstr "我收到來自滙豐的短訊時，應該怎樣處理－如何判斷短訊的真僞？"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4733 HSBC _ and fraud frontend/templates/How report security
#: to
msgid ""
"Your credit card security is important to us. We're committed to "
"enhancing our fraud detection system, and we’re always looking for the "
"best ways to protect you from fraud."
msgstr "我們非常重視您的信用卡安全，並致力提升偵測詐騙的系統，務求以最佳方式保護您免受詐騙的威脅。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4736 HSBC _ and fraud frontend/templates/How report security
#: to
msgid ""
"So if we detect a suspicious transaction on your card, we'll send you an "
"SMS alert."
msgstr "如果我們發現您的信用卡出現可疑交易，會向您發送短訊提示。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4739 HSBC _ and fraud frontend/templates/How report security
#: to
msgid ""
"Here's what to do if you receive one of these alerts, and how to check "
"that the message is from us and not a fraudster."
msgstr "請參考以下指示回覆，並時刻慎防僞冒滙豐的詐騙短訊。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4749 HSBC _ and fraud frontend/templates/How report security
#: to
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The purpose of this message is to confirm whether a transaction is "
"genuine or not."
msgstr "我們會透過雙向交易短訊向您確認交易是否經過您的授權。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4753 HSBC _ and fraud frontend/templates/How report security
#: to
msgid ""
"If you receive an SMS, just answer \"Y\" or \"Yes\" if you made the "
"payment or \"N\" or \"No\" if you didn't."
msgstr "您收到有關短訊時，如交易屬實並由您本人支付，只須回覆「Y」或「Yes」確認，否則請回覆「N」或「No」。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4757 HSBC _ and fraud frontend/templates/How report security
#: to
msgid "Please don't share any sensitive personal information when replying to us."
msgstr "回覆我們的短訊時，請勿分享任何敏感的個人資料。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4797 HSBC _ and fraud frontend/templates/How report security
#: to
msgid ""
"Then check if the transaction is successful. On some occasions, payment "
"may be declined due to security reasons. If that happens, you'll need to "
"make the transaction again."
msgstr "回覆通知後，請檢查交易是否成功。有時，交易可能會由於保安原因被拒絕。如被拒絕，請再次進行有關交易。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:1748 HK.html:2001 HK.html:4833 HSBC _ and card credit fraud
#: frontend/templates/How frontend/templates/Preventing report security to
msgid ""
"We'll decline the transaction and block your card. We'll also reach out "
"to you between 9am-10:30pm HKT to understand more about this. You can "
"help fight fraud too. Get in touch with us immediately after you've "
"responded with 'N'."
msgstr ""
"我們會拒絕相關交易和封鎖你的卡，並與您聯絡（香港時間每日上午9時 – "
"下午10時30分期間）了解詳情。您可以在選擇「N」後，和我們聯絡，攜手打擊信用卡騙案。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4860 HSBC _ and fraud frontend/templates/How report security
#: to
msgid ""
"Fraudsters might impersonate us and send you messages, asking you to "
"provide sensitive personal information or click on a link."
msgstr "騙徒可能會偽冒滙豐，向您發送詐騙短訊，要求您提供敏感的個人資料或點擊來歷不明的連結。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4864 HSBC _ and fraud frontend/templates/How report security
#: to
msgid ""
"We may send you alerts to keep you up to date on your account activities "
"or to check that a transaction is genuine. However, we will never ask you"
" to provide sensitive personal information such as your identity document"
" number, credit card details (credit card number, expiry date, card "
"verification value printed on the back of credit card), online banking "
"passwords or one-time password (OTP)."
msgstr "我們的確會向您發送短訊提示，以通知您近期的信用卡交易情況，或者向您確認交易是否屬實。但請注意，我們絕對不會透過短訊要求您提供任何敏感的個人資料，例如身份證明文件號碼、信用卡資料（信用卡號碼、到期日及印於信用卡背面的安全碼）、網上理財密碼或一次性密碼（OTP）。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4868 HSBC _ and fraud frontend/templates/How report security
#: to
msgid ""
