"reply or click on any links, or open any attachments. It could be an "
"attempt at phishing."
msgstr "如果您收到的電郵，它的外觀、感覺或內容都跟以往收到的滙豐電郵不同，千萬不要回覆、點擊任何連結或開啟任何附件。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4937 HSBC _ and fraud frontend/templates/How report security
