#: - Cyber HK.html:5053 HSBC _ and fraud frontend/templates/How report security
#: to
msgid ""
"If you lost your credit card, or believe it might have been stolen or "
"misused, please report it via the HSBC HK Mobile Banking app or HSBC "
"Online Banking. Learn how to"
msgstr "如果您遺失信用卡，或者懷疑信用卡被盗竊或盗用，請通過香港滙豐流動理財應用程式或登入網上理財報失信用卡。要了解詳情，請根據"

