#: - Cyber Fraud HK.html:4416 HSBC Measures Safety Security _ and
#: frontend/templates/Malware
msgid ""
"We've rolled out new safety measures on the Android version of the HSBC "
"HK App to protect you from potential malware-related fraud. Learn more "
"about the malware scams, the features we've added to protect you, and "
"tips to keep yourself safe."
msgstr ""
"我們已為HSBC HK "
"App的Android版本加入全新的安全措施，加強阻截不法之徒透過惡意軟件掌控您的Android裝置，以保障您的戶口安全。細閱本頁面，了解您需要留心提防的惡意軟件騙案，新安全措施的內容，以及網路安全貼士。"

