#: - Cyber Fraud HK.html:4481 HK.html:6752 HSBC Measures Safety Security _ and
#: frontend/templates/Malware
msgid "Tips to protect yourself from malware"
msgstr "如何保護自己免受惡意軟件侵害"

#: - Cyber Fraud HK.html:4507 HSBC Measures Safety Security _ and
#: frontend/templates/Malware
msgid ""
"We've seen a rise in malware fraud cases. They happen when fraudsters "
"direct victims to download and install malicious apps on their Android "
"device. This then gives them access to the victims' Android devices to "
"allow them to conduct unauthorised transactions."
msgstr ""
"我們觀察到惡意軟件騙案日趨猖獗，當中涉及騙徒欺騙受害人於Android裝置下載並安裝含惡意軟件的應用程式，讓他們取得受害人Android "
"裝置的存取權限並進行未經授權交易。"

#: - Cyber Fraud HK.html:4510 HSBC Measures Safety Security _ and
#: frontend/templates/Malware
msgid "Our new safety measure can help protect you from such malware."
msgstr "我們的全新安全措施可協助您防範此類惡意軟件騙案。"

#: - Cyber Fraud HK.html:4522 HSBC Measures Safety Security _ and
#: frontend/templates/Malware
msgid "Learn more on how malware scams work"
msgstr "詳細了解惡意軟件騙案的運作方式"

#: - Cyber Fraud HK.html:4536 HSBC Measures Safety Security _ and
#: frontend/templates/Malware
msgid ""
"Investigations have found that fraudsters create fake ads on social media"
" and via messages. These ads promote special offers for groceries, "
"concert tickets, vacation packages, etc. To redeem the offer, victims are"
" then asked to download what looks like a genuine shopping app, from "
"sources other than their phone’s official app stores. But that app "
"contains malware."
msgstr "調查發現，騙徒會透過社交媒體／訊息發布虛假廣告，推銷特別優惠，例如訂購日用品、音樂會門票、度假套票等等。要求受害人從非手機官方應用商店下載仿真購物應用程式，以獲取相關優惠，但實際上卻是含有惡意軟件的虛假應用程式。"

#: - Cyber Fraud HK.html:4539 HSBC Measures Safety Security _ and
#: frontend/templates/Malware
msgid ""
"Once the fraudsters have taken over the Android devices, they'll log on "
"to the victims' banking app, steal personal information and make "
"unauthorised transactions."
msgstr "一旦Android 裝置被掌控，騙徒便能登入受害人的銀行應用程式，盜取各項敏感個人資料及作未經授權的交易。"

#: - Cyber Fraud HK.html:4575 HSBC Measures Safety Security _ and
#: frontend/templates/Malware
msgid ""
"If we detect potential risks on your Android device, we'll suspend your "
"access to the HSBC HK App from this device for your protection."
msgstr "如我們識別到您的Android裝置有潛在風險，我們將暫停您於這部裝置使用HSBC HK App，以保障您的戶口安全。"

