msgstr "開放銀行服務"

#: & - API Banking HK.html:4398 HSBC How It Open Works _
#: frontend/templates/Open
msgid ""
"With more control over your data, you can use it to enjoy an innovative "
"and enhanced banking experience."
msgstr "戶口資料盡在掌握，為您帶來創新升級的理財體驗。"

#: & - API Banking HK.html:4405 HSBC How It Open Works _
#: frontend/templates/Open
msgid ""
"Open Banking allows you to share your data digitally with third-party "
"service providers in a simple and secure way."
msgstr "開放銀行服務讓您安全快捷地與第三方服務提供者分享您的資料。"

#: & - API Banking HK.html:4412 HSBC How It Open Works _
#: frontend/templates/Open
msgid "What is Open Banking?"
msgstr "甚麼是「開放銀行」？"

#: & - API Banking HK.html:4419 HSBC How It Open Works _
#: frontend/templates/Open
msgid ""
"Open Banking uses Open Application Programming Interface (Open API) to "
"enable the sharing of product information and account data with your "
"consent. Open API allows secure and efficient data communication between "
"HSBC and our trusted third-party service providers (TSPs, including "
"Interbank Account Data Sharing participating banks)."
msgstr ""
"「開放銀行」使用「開放式應用程式介面」（Open "
"API）分享產品資訊，及在獲得您的授權後安全有效地分別獲取和分享您在第三方服務提供者（TSPs，包括戶口互聯（IADS）參與銀行）和滙豐銀行的戶口資料。"

#: & - API Banking HK.html:4422 HSBC How It Open Works _
#: frontend/templates/Open
msgid ""
"Open Banking unlocks opportunities for a wide collection of innovative "
"applications. This includes providing a consolidated view of your various"
" bank accounts, facilitating management of your finances and offering "
"more personalised products and services."
msgstr "「開放銀行」可讓您體驗一系列創新的理財應用，包括一站式查閲您於多間銀行的戶口結餘，協助您管理財務，並讓我們為您提供更個人化的產品和服務。"

#: & - API Banking HK.html:4427 HSBC How It Open Works _
