#: & - API Banking HK.html:4448 HSBC How It Open Works _
#: frontend/templates/Open
msgid "What is Interbank Account Data Sharing (IADS)?"
msgstr "甚麼是戶口互聯（IADS）？"

#: & - API Banking HK.html:4455 HSBC How It Open Works _
#: frontend/templates/Open
msgid ""
"The Hong Kong Monetary Authority (HKMA) Interbank Account Data Sharing "
"(IADS) initiative allows the sharing of your deposit account data, with "
"your consent, between the participating banks using Open API."
msgstr "香港金融管理局（HKMA）的戶口互聯（IADS）計劃讓參與銀行在獲得您的授權後，透過開放式API與其他銀行分享您的戶口資料。"

#: & - API Banking HK.html:4458 HSBC How It Open Works _
#: frontend/templates/Open
msgid ""
"You remain in full control, selecting which accounts' data you'd like to "
"share, for how long and with which bank. You can choose to cancel your "
"consent at any time."
msgstr "您將保留全面的控制權，包括可以選擇分享哪些戶口資料，分享期間的長短，以及與哪些銀行分享。您任何時候都可以取消授權。"

#: & - API Banking HK.html:4461 HSBC How It Open Works _
#: frontend/templates/Open
msgid ""
"Save time checking the balance of your numerous bank accounts and get a "
"consolidated view of your deposit accounts with the HSBC HK App. We'll "
"connect securely to your other banks, saving you the hassle of logging on"
" to various other applications. Enjoy a more seamless banking service "
"along with personalised offers."
msgstr ""
"透過香港滙豐流動理財應用程式 "
"，您能夠一站式查閲您於多間銀行的戶口結餘。我們會安全地連接至其他銀行，令您毋須登入其他銀行的應用程式，即可享有順暢無縫的理財體驗，以及個人化的優惠。"

