msgstr "選擇滙豐能夠存取您戶口資料的期限。"

#: & - API Banking HK.html:4508 HSBC How It Open Works _
#: frontend/templates/Open
msgid ""
"We'll redirect you to your selected bank's website or application. Log on"
" and select the bank accounts whose data you want to share with HSBC. "
"You'll be automatically returned to a confirmation page on the HSBC HK "
"App."
msgstr "您將跳轉至所選銀行的網站或應用程式，登入後選擇您希望與滙豐分享的戶口資料。然後，您將被帶回HSBC HK App的確認頁面，顯示您已成功建立授權。"

#: & - API Banking HK.html:4513 HSBC How It Open Works _
