msgid ""
"Our all-in-one account offers a comprehensive digital banking experience "
"with exclusive lifestyle benefits and great rewards!"
msgstr "一個戶口有齊網上理財、獨家生活禮遇同豐富獎賞，全面Upgrade你嘅數碼銀行服務體驗。"

#: - And Cyber Fraud HK.html:9 HSBC Security _ frontend/templates/Prevent
msgid "Prevent Fraud | Cyber Security And Fraud - HSBC HK"
msgstr "防詐騙三大法則 | 網絡安全及防詐騙資訊 - 香港滙豐"

#: - And Cyber Fraud HK.html:83 HSBC Security _ frontend/templates/Prevent
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Don't fall for social engineering scams. Criminals posing as police might"
" call you and demand your bank details, something real police would never"
" do."
msgstr "電話詐騙和網上騙案日益猖獗，騙徒手法層出不窮，總是想盡辦法利用心理弱點，套取您的個人資料和信任，讓您雙手奉上金錢。防範詐騙的第一度防線，正是您自己。"

#: - And Cyber Fraud HK.html:4410 HSBC Security _ frontend/templates/Prevent
msgid ""
"Criminals are getting more sophisticated with telephone scams and online "
"scams. Here are our top tips for a great defence."
msgstr "電話詐騙和網上騙案日益猖獗，稍一不慎就可能墮入騙局。防範詐騙的第一度防線，其實就是您自己。"

#: - And Cyber Fraud HK.html:4417 HSBC Security _ frontend/templates/Prevent
msgid ""
"In 2019, the Anti-Deception Coordination Centre intercepted nearly HKD3 "
"billion that was on its way to hackers and fraudsters – up by 1.5 times"
msgstr "2019年，反詐騙協調中心成功攔截的電話及網上騙案金額，超過港幣30億元"

#: - And Cyber Fraud HK.html:4424 HSBC Security _ frontend/templates/Prevent
msgid "Footnote link 1"
msgstr ""

#: - And Cyber Fraud HK.html:4435 HSBC Security _ frontend/templates/Prevent
msgid "Footnote link 2"
msgstr ""

#: - And Cyber Fraud HK.html:4446 HSBC Security _ frontend/templates/Prevent
msgid "Be very cautious about how you share your personal information"
msgstr "切勿輕易透露個人資料"

#: - And Cyber Fraud HK.html:4457 HSBC Security _ frontend/templates/Prevent
msgid ""
"Please provide your account information and one-time password to confirm "
"your identity."
msgstr "請提供戶口資料及一次性密碼確認身分。"

#: - And Cyber Fraud HK.html:4466 HSBC Security _ frontend/templates/Prevent
msgid ""
"If you hear or see those words, consider it a red flag. Remember, never "
"disclose sensitive personal information such as your account or credit "
"card information or password to anyone."
msgstr "毋須再懷疑了，聽到這句說話，對方一定是騙徒。緊記切勿向任何人透露戶口、信用卡資料和密碼等個人敏感資料。"

#: - And Cyber Fraud HK.html:4474 HSBC Security _ frontend/templates/Prevent
msgid ""
"You should also enhance the security of your online banking and adopt "
"measures, such as"
msgstr "您亦應加强網上銀行保安，採用"

#: - And Cyber Fraud HK.html:4475 HSBC Security _ frontend/templates/Prevent
msgid "multiple login authentication"
msgstr "多重登入認證"

#: - And Cyber Fraud HK.html:4482 HSBC Security _ frontend/templates/Prevent
msgid "If it sounds too good to be true, it probably is"
msgstr "勿貪小便宜"

#: - And Cyber Fraud HK.html:4493 HSBC Security _ frontend/templates/Prevent
msgid ""
"Even if you can't provide a proof of income, we can definitely help you "
"borrow money at a very preferential interest rate."
msgstr "就算沒有入息證明，都一定可以幫您用超優惠利率借錢。"

#: - And Cyber Fraud HK.html:4506 HSBC Security _ frontend/templates/Prevent
msgid ""
"Just pay a small fee or make a deposit, and your loan will be approved "
"immediately."
msgstr "先繳交費用或按金，貸款就可以立即獲批。"

#: - And Cyber Fraud HK.html:4519 HSBC Security _ frontend/templates/Prevent
msgid ""
"Congratulations! You've won a big prize. To claim your prize, simply pay "
"a small administrative fee."
msgstr "您中大獎了，只要繳交行政費，就可以取得獎項。"

#: - And Cyber Fraud HK.html:4528 HSBC Security _ frontend/templates/Prevent
msgid ""
"Scammers are experts at preying on people's interest in easy victories "
"and desire to get rich quick. They'll offer you attractive services or "
"generous rewards, that can all be yours... as long as you make an advance"
" payment."
msgstr "騙徒最擅長捉摸大眾「貪著數」的心理，向您開出很吸引的服務或優厚的回報，引誘您心甘情願墊支款項，換取異常豐厚的「著數」。"

#: - And Cyber Fraud HK.html:4531 HSBC Security _ frontend/templates/Prevent
msgid ""
"When you come across these \"offers\", remember the old saying: there's "
"no such thing as a free lunch. There will almost always be a hidden cost,"
" especially if an offer sounds too good to be true."
msgstr "遇上這些對白，先問自己：世上哪有免費的午餐？我會不會因小失大？"

#: - And Cyber Fraud HK.html:4544 HSBC Security _ frontend/templates/Prevent
msgid "Keep calm, don't panic"
msgstr "保持冷靜，不要慌張"

#: - And Cyber Fraud HK.html:4555 HSBC Security _ frontend/templates/Prevent
msgid ""
"You're suspected of a criminal offense. You have to hand over your online"
" bank account, password or money to prove your innocence."
msgstr "您涉嫌觸犯法律，您需要交出網上銀行戶口、密碼或款項，證明清白。"

#: - And Cyber Fraud HK.html:4568 HSBC Security _ frontend/templates/Prevent
msgid ""
"We found abnormal transactions in your account. If you don't provide your"
" account password for confirmation, your account will be frozen."
msgstr "我們發現您的戶口有異常交易，如不提供戶口密碼作確認，您的戶口將被凍結。"

#: - And Cyber Fraud HK.html:4577 HSBC Security _ frontend/templates/Prevent
msgid ""
"In addition to offering you unbelievable deals, scammers will also take "
"advantage of your fears. They might claim to be law enforcement officers,"
" government officials or bank employees, and tell you that you're "
"involved in legal or financial troubles and frighten you into providing "
"sensitive information or even money."
msgstr "除了您的「貪念」之外，騙徒還會利用您的恐懼心理，自稱執法部門人員、政府或銀行職員，聲稱您遇上法律或財務問題，令您在恐慌之下向他們提供敏感資料或金錢「洗脫嫌疑」。"

#: - And Cyber Fraud HK.html:4580 HSBC Security _ frontend/templates/Prevent
msgid ""
"If you encounter this scenario, please remain calm. Call back the bank or"
" institution to verify the caller. Don't let yourself be scared into "
"something that doesn't feel right."
msgstr "如果遇上這些情況，請保持冷靜，並再三向機構或銀行核實對方身分。覺得不對勁時，不要輕舉妄動。"

#: - And Cyber Fraud HK.html:4589 HSBC Security _ frontend/templates/Prevent
msgid ""
"Whether it's on social media, by email or on the phone, scammers will try"
" their best to steal your personal information and money, riding on your "
"psychological weaknesses to obtain your personal data and your trust. "
"Don't rely on others. Learn how to protect yourself."
msgstr "無論是用社交媒體、電郵還是電話，騙徒手法雖然層出不窮，但萬變不離其宗，總是想盡辦法利用心理弱點，套取您的個人資料和信任，讓您雙手奉上金錢。防範詐騙，靠的不是別人，正是您自己。"

#: - And Cyber Fraud HK.html:4595 HSBC Security _ frontend/templates/Prevent
msgid "Think you might have encountered fraud? Please"
msgstr "萬一遭遇詐騙， 請即"

#: - And Cyber Fraud HK.html:4596 HSBC Security _ frontend/templates/Prevent
msgid "report it"
msgstr "向我們舉報"

#: - And Cyber Fraud HK.html:4815 HSBC Security _ frontend/templates/Prevent
msgid ""
"If you believe you are a victim of any fraudulent activity, report it to "
"us immediately."
msgstr "如果您懷疑遭到詐騙，請盡快向我們舉報。"

#: - And Cyber Fraud HK.html:2326 HK.html:4922 HSBC Security _ and card credit
#: fraud frontend/templates/Prevent frontend/templates/Preventing security
msgid "Notes"
msgstr "註"

#: - And Cyber Fraud HK.html:4928 HSBC Security _ frontend/templates/Prevent
msgid ""
"SCMP, 2 March 2020, Hong Kong police intercept more than US$384 million "
"swindled from victims of internet and phone scams around world."
msgstr ""
"SCMP, 2 March 2020, Hong Kong police intercept more than US$384 million "
"swindled from victims of internet and phone scams around world."

#: - And Cyber Fraud HK.html:4933 HSBC Security _ frontend/templates/Prevent
msgid "Data acquired from HSBC Cyber Security Survey 2020."
msgstr "數據來自滙豐網絡安全調查2020。"

