#: - Cyber HK.html:879 HSBC _ and card credit fraud
#: frontend/templates/Preventing security
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Credit cards are certainly a very popular payment choice, with an average"
" of 2 credit cards held per person. But it's something that fraudsters "
"could take advantage of."
msgstr "平時購物以信用卡付款越見普及，平均一個人就有兩張信用卡。但同時亦會令騙徒有機可乘，用五花八門的技倆盜用您的信用卡。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:882 HSBC _ and card credit fraud
#: frontend/templates/Preventing security
msgid ""
"Credit card fraud can happen in a number of ways, such as unauthorised "
"use in which fraudsters try to purchase goods or steal money using your "
"credit. It could also involve lost and stolen credit cards, making "
"fraudulent applications or transactions like online payments and mail "
"orders."
msgstr "信用卡詐騙有很多種類型，常見的例如有人在未經您授權下，使用您的信用卡來購物或套現、遺失的信用卡被盜用、以不正當手段申請信用卡、亦或盜取受害人的信用卡資料進行網上購物及交易。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:885 HSBC _ and card credit fraud
#: frontend/templates/Preventing security
msgid ""
"Here are some tips to help you protect yourself from falling victim to "
"credit card fraud."
msgstr "以下我們為您提供多項用卡安全小貼士，保護自己免受信用卡詐騙威脅。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:919 HK.html:952 HSBC _ and card credit fraud
