msgid "Protecting yourself before using your card"
msgstr "使用信用卡／扣賬卡前，多一分留心"

#: - Cyber HK.html:929 HK.html:2102 HSBC _ and card credit fraud
#: frontend/templates/Preventing security
msgid "Safeguarding yourself when using your card"
msgstr "使用信用卡／扣賬卡時，提高警覺性"

#: - Cyber HK.html:934 HK.html:2200 HSBC _ and card credit fraud
#: frontend/templates/Preventing security
msgid "Reporting suspicious activities on your card"
msgstr "發現可疑交易，即通知我們"

#: - Cyber HK.html:958 HSBC _ and card credit fraud
#: frontend/templates/Preventing security
msgid ""
"Starting from March 2024, you can authenticate your online transactions "
"in a more secure way by using the HSBC HK App Online Transaction "
"Authentication Service. If you've installed the HSBC HK App and "
"registered for mobile banking service, you'll be asked to authenticate "
"online transactions via HSBC HK App"
msgstr ""
"由2024年3月起，您可以使用香港滙豐流動理財應用程式網上交易認證服務，認證您的網上交易。如您已安裝HSBC HK "
"App及登記滙豐流動理財，您毋須再以短訊收取一次性驗證碼，並可使用HSBC HK App"

#: - Cyber HK.html:970 HSBC _ and card credit fraud
#: frontend/templates/Preventing security
msgid ""
"To use HSBC HK App Online Transaction Authentication Service, make sure "
"you’ve:"
msgstr "使用香港滙豐流動理財應用程式網上交易認證服務前，請確保您已："

#: - Cyber HK.html:996 HSBC _ and card credit fraud
#: frontend/templates/Preventing security
msgid "Authenticate single online transaction via HSBC HK App"
msgstr "如何透過HSBC HK App認證單項網上交易"

#: - Cyber HK.html:1002 HSBC _ and card credit fraud
#: frontend/templates/Preventing security
msgid "Steps to authenticate single online transaction"
msgstr "認證單項網上交易的步驟如下："

#: - Cyber HK.html:1030 HK.html:1196 HSBC _ and card credit fraud
#: frontend/templates/Preventing security
msgid ""
"We'll send you a push notification after you've provided your payment "
"details on the merchant site."
msgstr "在商戶網站提供付款詳細資訊後，我們會向您發送推播通知。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:1059 HK.html:1225 HSBC _ and card credit fraud
#: frontend/templates/Preventing security
msgid ""
"Tap on the push notification from HSBC HK within 3 minutes to go to HSBC "
"HK App."
msgstr "於3分鐘內點按推播通知，並登入HSBC HK App。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:1087 HK.html:1253 HSBC _ and card credit fraud
#: frontend/templates/Preventing security
msgid "Log on to the HSBC HK App."
msgstr "登入HSBC HK App。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:1115 HSBC _ and card credit fraud
#: frontend/templates/Preventing security
msgid ""
"Check the transaction details carefully and tap on 'Approve' to "
"authenticate your online transaction. If you don't recognise the "
"transaction, select \"Reject\" to decline the payment."
msgstr "請仔細檢查交易詳情，然後再點選「同意」以認證交易。如您對此交易沒有印象，請點選「拒絕」取消交易。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:1143 HSBC _ and card credit fraud
#: frontend/templates/Preventing security
msgid ""
"Use biometric authentication or enter your 6-digit Mobile Banking PIN to "
"authenticate the transaction, then return to the merchant site to "
"complete your payment."
msgstr "使用生物認證或輸入6位數字流動理財PIN認證交易，然後返回商戶網站完成付款。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:1162 HSBC _ and card credit fraud
#: frontend/templates/Preventing security
msgid "Authenticate multiple online transactions via HSBC HK App"
msgstr "如何透過HSBC HK App認證多項網上交易"

#: - Cyber HK.html:1168 HSBC _ and card credit fraud
#: frontend/templates/Preventing security
msgid "Steps to authenticate multiple online transactions"
msgstr "認證多項網上交易的步驟如下："

#: - Cyber HK.html:1281 HSBC _ and card credit fraud
#: frontend/templates/Preventing security
msgid ""
"You'll be shown the number of online transactions require authentication."
" Check each transaction detail carefully and tap on 'Approve' to "
"authenticate each of them. If you don't recognise the transaction, select"
" \"Reject\" to decline the payment."
msgstr "畫面會顯示您即將認證的網上交易數目，請仔細檢查交易詳情，再點選「同意」以逐一認證每項交易。如您對此交易沒有印象，請點選「拒絕」取消交易。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:1309 HSBC _ and card credit fraud
#: frontend/templates/Preventing security
msgid ""
"Use biometric authentication or enter your 6-digit Mobile Banking PIN to "
"authenticate the first transaction, then return to the merchant site to "
"complete your payment, or tap on 'Next transaction' to approve further "
"transactions."
msgstr "使用生物認證或您的6位數字流動理財PIN認證第一項交易，然後返回商戶網站完成付款，或點選「檢視另一項交易」以認證下一項交易。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:1328 HSBC _ and card credit fraud
#: frontend/templates/Preventing security
msgid "Frequently asked questions"
msgstr "常見問題"

#: - Cyber HK.html:1349 HSBC _ and card credit fraud
#: frontend/templates/Preventing security
#, fuzzy
msgid "What’s the online transaction authentication service?"
msgstr "使用香港滙豐流動理財應用程式網上交易認證服務前，請確保您已："

#: - Cyber HK.html:1363 HSBC _ and card credit fraud
#: frontend/templates/Preventing security
msgid ""
"It lets you review and approve your online payments safely and "
"conveniently. Simply log on to the HSBC HK App to approve or reject them."
msgstr "網上交易認證服務讓您以安全、方便的方式認證網上交易。在成功登入HSBC HK App，核對並同意交易後，即可完成支付。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:1381 HSBC _ and card credit fraud
#: frontend/templates/Preventing security
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"I was already logged on to the HSBC HK App when I made an online "
"transaction with a merchant. When I went back to the HSBC HK App, I "
"couldn’t find any authentication requests. How do I approve the "
"transaction?"
msgstr "我與商戶進行網上交易時，已經登入HSBC HK App。當我返回HSBC HK App時，我找不到任何確認付款指示。我怎樣才能同意付款？"

#: - Cyber HK.html:1395 HSBC _ and card credit fraud
#: frontend/templates/Preventing security
msgid ""
"If you’ve received a push notification for the transaction, tap it and "
"follow the instructions to approve the transaction."
msgstr "如果您收到有關交易的推播通知，請點選推播通知並按照指示確認付款。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:1398 HSBC _ and card credit fraud
#: frontend/templates/Preventing security
msgid ""
"If you haven’t received one, please log off, then log on again to approve"
" the transaction."
msgstr "如您收不到通知，請登出HSBC HK App並重新登入，以檢視相關付款指示。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:1401 HSBC _ and card credit fraud
#: frontend/templates/Preventing security
msgid "Please note that you have 3 minutes to approve it."
msgstr "請注意，您須於3分鐘內認證交易。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:1419 HSBC _ and card credit fraud
#: frontend/templates/Preventing security
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"When I shopped online with this merchant last time, I authenticated my "
"transactions in the HSBC HK App. Why do I have to do it by verification "
"code this time?"
msgstr "我之前於支援3D安全技術的商戶網站進行交易時，曾使用HSBC HK App認證交易。為何這次會向我發送驗證碼？&nbsp;"

#: - Cyber HK.html:1433 HSBC _ and card credit fraud
#: frontend/templates/Preventing security
msgid ""
"The service may be temporarily unavailable. This might happen when we’re "
"maintaining and updating our banking services. So we’ll send you a "
"verification code instead. This way, you can keep shopping online with "
"your card while we work in the background to improve our services."
msgstr "該服務可能暫時未能提供，原因可能是理財服務系統的定期維護或更新。為免影響您使用銀行卡消費，我們會向您的已登記手提電話號碼發送驗證碼以進行交易認證。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:1456 HSBC _ and card credit fraud
#: frontend/templates/Preventing security
msgid "See all frequently asked questions"
msgstr "查看所有常見問題"

#: - Cyber HK.html:1494 HSBC _ and card credit fraud
#: frontend/templates/Preventing security
msgid ""
"Card Fraud Alert is our way of verifying with customers whenever we "
"detect a suspicious transaction on HSBC cards."
msgstr "如果我們發現您的信用卡／扣賬卡出現可疑交易，就會向您發送信用卡／扣賬卡可疑交易通知。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:1497 HSBC _ and card credit fraud
#: frontend/templates/Preventing security
msgid ""
"Once you receive a notification via the HSBC HK App or SMS, start by "
"carefully verifying all the merchant details, payment amount, currency, "
"as well as the date and time of the transaction. Then simply let us know "
"if you're the one who made the transaction."
msgstr ""
"在HSBC HK "
"App或電話短訊收到通知時，請先仔細驗證所有商戶的詳細資料、付款金額、貨幣及交易日期和時間，然後向我們確認交易是否由您本人授權即可。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:1513 HSBC _ and card credit fraud
#: frontend/templates/Preventing security
msgid "How does Card Fraud Alert work?"
msgstr "信用卡／扣賬卡「可疑交易通知」怎樣運作？"

#: - Cyber HK.html:1529 HK.html:1904 HSBC _ and card credit fraud
#: frontend/templates/Preventing security
#, fuzzy
msgid "2-way SMS"
msgstr "雙向交易短訊"

#: - Cyber HK.html:1571 HK.html:1809 HSBC _ and card credit fraud
#: frontend/templates/Preventing security
msgid "With your push notifications turned on"
msgstr "只要啓用接收推播通知"

#: - Cyber HK.html:1576 HK.html:1814 HSBC _ and card credit fraud
#: frontend/templates/Preventing security
msgid ""
"Once you tap on it, you'll be directed to the HSBC HK App where you'll "
"see transaction details after logging on. Before confirming if the "
"transaction is genuine, please check and verify the merchant details, "
"payment amount and currency, as well as the date and time of the "
"transaction."
msgstr "點擊通知後，即可開啓HSBC HK App，並可在登入後查閱交易詳情。在確認交易是否屬實前，請仔細檢查商戶的資料、金額、貨幣、交易日期及時間。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:1579 HK.html:1817 HSBC _ and card credit fraud
#: frontend/templates/Preventing security
msgid ""
"We may also notify you via a message on the HSBC HK App homepage after "
"you log on. Similar to the pop-up notifications, tap on the message and "
"let us know or call us as required on the screen."
msgstr "我們亦可能會在您登入HSBC HK App後向您發出交易通知。與彈出式通知一樣，您可以點擊通知以確認交易，或按照通知上的指示致電聯絡我們。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:1616 HK.html:1854 HSBC _ and card credit fraud
#: frontend/templates/Preventing security
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Then check whether the transaction is successful. On some occasions, "
"payment may be declined due to security reasons. If that happens, you'll "
"need to make the transaction again."
msgstr "回覆通知後，請檢查交易是否成功。有時，交易可能會由於保安原因被拒絕。如被拒絕，請再次進行有關交易。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:1645 HK.html:1883 HSBC _ and card credit fraud
#: frontend/templates/Preventing security
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"We'll decline the transaction and also reach out to you between "
"9am-10:30pm HKT to understand more about this."
msgstr "我們會拒絕相關交易，並與您聯絡（香港時間每日上午9時 – 下午10時30分期間），了解詳情。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:1648 HK.html:1886 HSBC _ and card credit fraud
#: frontend/templates/Preventing security
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You can help fight fraud too. Get in touch with us immediately via the "
"app after you've responded with 'No'."
msgstr "您也可以在選擇「否」後，和我們聯絡，攜手打擊信用卡騙案。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:1665 HK.html:1918 HSBC _ and card credit fraud
#: frontend/templates/Preventing security
#, fuzzy
msgid "We'll send you a 2-way SMS about suspicious transactions if you:"
msgstr "在以下情況下，我們會透過雙向交易短訊發送可疑交易提示："

#: - Cyber HK.html:1679 HK.html:1932 HSBC _ and card credit fraud
#: frontend/templates/Preventing security
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Before responding if the transaction is genuine, you should carefully "
"check and verify the merchant details, payment amount and currency, as "
"well as the date and time of the transaction."
msgstr "在回覆交易是否屬實前，請仔細檢查商戶的資料、金額、貨幣、交易日期及時間。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:1714 HK.html:1967 HSBC _ and card credit fraud
#: frontend/templates/Preventing security
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Then check if the transaction is successful. On some occasions, payment "
"may be declined due to security reasons. If that happens, you'll need to "
"make the transaction again."
msgstr "回覆通知後，請檢查交易是否成功。有時，交易可能會由於保安原因被拒絕。如被拒絕，請再次進行有關交易。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:2032 HSBC _ and card credit fraud
#: frontend/templates/Preventing security
#, fuzzy
msgid "Start by turning on push notifications on the HSBC HK App"
msgstr "在HSBC HK App上開啟推播通知"

#: - Cyber HK.html:2060 HSBC _ and card credit fraud
#: frontend/templates/Preventing security
msgid ""
"If you already have push notifications turned on for the HSBC HK App, "
"then you're all set to receive these alerts."
msgstr "如果您已於HSBC HK App啟用接收推播通知功能，您將收到付款確認通知。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:2063 HSBC _ and card credit fraud
#: frontend/templates/Preventing security
msgid ""
"Otherwise, please follow these steps to turn on push notifications for "
"the HSBC HK App:"
msgstr "否則，請按照以下步驟在HSBC HK App中啟用推播通知："

#: - Cyber HK.html:2122 HSBC _ and card credit fraud
#: frontend/templates/Preventing security
msgid "Shop only at secure, trustworthy websites"
msgstr "確保網購平台安全可信"

#: - Cyber HK.html:2125 HSBC _ and card credit fraud
#: frontend/templates/Preventing security
msgid ""
"Check that the website address starts with 'https' and that there's a "
"padlock icon in the address bar."
msgstr "網址應該以「https」開頭，網址欄亦會顯示掛鎖圖案。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:2135 HSBC _ and card credit fraud
#: frontend/templates/Preventing security
msgid "Authenticate your online transactions with a more secure way"
msgstr "以更安全可靠的方式認證網上交易"

#: - Cyber HK.html:2138 HSBC _ and card credit fraud
#: frontend/templates/Preventing security
msgid ""
"When shopping at supported online merchants, use the new HSBC HK App "
"Online Transaction Authentication Service to securely authenticate your "
"online transactions instead of SMS OTP."
msgstr "於支援有關服務的網上商戶進行交易時，您可以使用香港滙豐流動理財應用程式網上交易認證服務，更安全便捷地認證您的網上交易，毋須再以短訊收取一次性驗證碼。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:2148 HSBC _ and card credit fraud
#: frontend/templates/Preventing security
msgid "Check the details in your OTP SMS"
msgstr "清楚檢查一次性密碼短訊"

#: - Cyber HK.html:2151 HSBC _ and card credit fraud
#: frontend/templates/Preventing security
msgid ""
"When you receive an OTP (one-time passcode) from HSBC, don't just look "
"for the 6-digit code and rush to act—check other essential information "
"including the merchant name, transaction time and amount so you can be "
"sure you're authorising the correct transaction."
msgstr ""

#: - Cyber HK.html:2161 HSBC _ and card credit fraud
#: frontend/templates/Preventing security
msgid "Review your transactions regularly"
msgstr "定期查閱信用卡／扣賬卡賬單"

#: - Cyber HK.html:2164 HSBC _ and card credit fraud
#: frontend/templates/Preventing security
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Log on to the HSBC HK App regularly or review your card statements and "
"the transactions in it carefully. Make sure that you recognise each "
"transaction made."
msgstr "定時登入香港滙豐流動理財應用程式，或仔細檢查您的信用卡／扣賬卡賬單及交易紀錄，並確保您授權所有交易。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:2174 HSBC _ and card credit fraud
#: frontend/templates/Preventing security
msgid "Never disclose any sensitive personal details"
msgstr "千萬不要透露敏感個人資料"

#: - Cyber HK.html:2177 HSBC _ and card credit fraud
#: frontend/templates/Preventing security
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Don't share your banking credentials, no matter how tempting the offer "
"may seem. Fraudsters may impersonate real organisations and use phishing "
"SMSes, emails, fake websites, bogus calls or malicious links to trick you"
" into sharing sensitive information such as your card number, CVC/CVV "
"number or OTPs."
msgstr "無論優惠有多吸引，也切勿因此而提供個人銀行戶口資料。緊記，騙徒經常會冒認各大機構，利用釣魚短訊及電郵、假冒網站和偽冒電話誘使您交出敏感的個人資料（例如信用卡／扣賬卡號碼、CVC／CVV安全碼及一次性密碼）或者要求您點擊可疑的連結。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:2214 HSBC _ and card credit fraud
#: frontend/templates/Preventing security
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"See a transaction you don't recognise? Don't worry, you can place a "
"temporary block on your card while you double-check your records or file "
"a report with us."
msgstr "對某些交易紀錄沒有印象？不要慌張，您可以暫時封鎖信用卡／扣賬卡，同時再三檢查您的交易紀錄或向我們舉報可疑交易。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:2232 HSBC _ and card credit fraud
#: frontend/templates/Preventing security
msgid "Place temporary block on your card"
msgstr "暫時封鎖信用卡／扣賬卡"

#: - Cyber HK.html:2246 HSBC _ and card credit fraud
#: frontend/templates/Preventing security
msgid ""
"If you've lost your card or you believe it might have been stolen or "
"misused, you can temporarily block it via the HSBC HK App, HSBC Online "
"Banking or by calling our 24/7 customer service hotline."
msgstr "如果您遺失信用卡／扣賬卡，或者懷疑信用卡／扣賬卡被盗竊或盗用，您可透過滙豐香港流動、網上理財應用程式或致電我們的客戶服務熱線封鎖信用卡／扣賬卡。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:2249 HSBC _ and card credit fraud
#: frontend/templates/Preventing security
msgid ""
"You can also report a lost or stolen card via our 24/7 customer service "
"hotline."
msgstr "您亦可致電我們的客戶服務熱線報失信用卡／扣賬卡。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:2252 HSBC _ and card credit fraud
#: frontend/templates/Preventing security
msgid ""
"To learn more on how to block a card, please visit the HSBC HK website "
"&gt; See FAQs, forms and fees &amp; charges &gt; Card support &gt; Report"
" lost or block your cards."
msgstr "想知更多如何封鎖信用卡？您可以瀏覽滙豐香港網站 &gt; 查看常見問題、表格及服務費用 &gt; 信用卡／扣賬卡支援 &gt; 報失或封鎖您的信用卡"

#: - Cyber HK.html:2270 HSBC _ and card credit fraud
#: frontend/templates/Preventing security
msgid "File a report with us"
msgstr "如果發現信用卡／扣賬卡出現可疑狀況"

#: - Cyber HK.html:2284 HSBC _ and card credit fraud
#: frontend/templates/Preventing security
msgid ""
"If you spot any suspicious activity or unauthorised transactions on your "
"cards, please call us to report them immediately."
msgstr "，或者有未經您授權的交易，請立即向我們回報。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:2334 HSBC _ and card credit fraud
#: frontend/templates/Preventing security
msgid ""
"If you haven't registered for mobile banking service or installed HSBC HK"
" App with Mobile Security Key activated and verified, then we will "
"continue sending SMS OTP to your registered mobile number for online "
"transaction authentication."
msgstr ""
"如您尚未登記滙豐流動理財，或安裝HSBC HK "
"App並啟動及驗證流動保安編碼，我們會繼續透過短訊發送一次性驗證碼至您登記的手提電話號碼，以驗證您的網上交易。"

#: - And Cyber Fraud HK.html:9 HSBC Scams Security _ frontend/templates/Romance
msgid "Romance Scams | Cyber Security And Fraud - HSBC HK"
msgstr "網戀騙局 | 網絡安全及防詐騙資訊中心 - 香港滙豐"

#: - And Cyber Fraud HK.html:4417 HSBC Scams Security _
#: frontend/templates/Romance
msgid ""
"You and I are one and the same: we both know what a broken heart feels "
"like. I'm so lucky to have found you."
msgstr "我同您一樣都受過情傷，遇上您實在太幸運！"

#: - And Cyber Fraud HK.html:4430 HSBC Scams Security _
#: frontend/templates/Romance
msgid "I really miss you. What have you been up to this past week?"
msgstr "我好掛住您，您呢幾日做咗啲乜？"

#: - And Cyber Fraud HK.html:4439 HSBC Scams Security _
#: frontend/templates/Romance
msgid ""
"While these sweet words may sound like music to anyone's ears, they could"
" also be a ploy used by scammers to catfish you and try to prompt you to "
"reveal more about your personal life."
msgstr "這些可能是一般的甜言蜜語，但也可能是網戀騙子假扮理想伴侶、打探個人背景的對白。"

#: - And Cyber Fraud HK.html:4442 HSBC Scams Security _
#: frontend/templates/Romance
msgid ""
"If you've never met this person in real life, you should be extra "
"careful. Scammers may invest time in building up a certain level of trust"
" with you to become a regular fixture in your life. Once that happens, "
"things could quickly start to go wrong:"
msgstr "如果對方是素未謀面的網友，那您就要加倍小心。在他們「放長線」與您建立信任，並成為您生活中的一部分後，對白就可能由普通的噓寒問暖，變成："

#: - And Cyber Fraud HK.html:4453 HSBC Scams Security _
#: frontend/templates/Romance
msgid ""
"I've been travelling and I'm out of town right now, so I can't meet up "
"with you. Also, can you believe my bad luck? My webcam has just stopped "
"working!"
msgstr "我唔喺香港，唔可以同您見面，咁啱個cam又壞咗，真黑仔！"

#: - And Cyber Fraud HK.html:4466 HSBC Scams Security _
#: frontend/templates/Romance
msgid ""
"I'm a little short on cash right now. Could you help me out by wiring "
"some money to tide me over? Even a few thousand dollars would help."
msgstr "我呢排周轉困難，您可唔可以匯款俾我？幾千蚊都得。"

#: - And Cyber Fraud HK.html:4475 HSBC Scams Security _
#: frontend/templates/Romance
msgid ""
"When someone you consider your 'online soulmate' is constantly making "
"excuses not to meet up and is always asking you for money, would you "
"still believe you've found 'the one'?"
msgstr "當您的「網上伴侶」不停推託和您見面，一次又一次地向您索取金錢，您還會相信對方嗎？"

#: - And Cyber Fraud HK.html:4482 HSBC Scams Security _
#: frontend/templates/Romance
msgid "Tips to protect your heart and your pocket from online love scams"
msgstr "防範網戀騙局貼士"

#: - And Cyber Fraud HK.html:4489 HSBC Scams Security _
#: frontend/templates/Romance
msgid ""
"Always stay alert. Never send money to people you don't know much about. "
"Don't give in to the initial rush of emotions you may feel after finding "
"a connection with someone online. Take a pause, look out for red flags "
"and take these steps before shelling out."
msgstr "不想當局者迷，人財兩失，就要時常保持警惕，不要輕易向認識不深的人匯款。當您為網上「真愛」情迷意亂的時候，先停一停，回想您倆相處時有沒有甚麼警號，再做好以下措施，不要將錢包雙手奉上。"

#: - And Cyber Fraud HK.html:4501 HSBC Scams Security _
#: frontend/templates/Romance
msgid "Protect your personal information"
msgstr "保護個人資料"

#: - And Cyber Fraud HK.html:4504 HSBC Scams Security _
#: frontend/templates/Romance
msgid ""
"Don't give sensitive information to people you've never met, including "
"your bank account details and passwords."
msgstr "千萬不要向素未謀面的人提供銀行戶口及密碼等敏感資料。"

#: - And Cyber Fraud HK.html:4509 HSBC Scams Security _
#: frontend/templates/Romance
msgid "Don't overshare your personal information on social media"
msgstr "避免在社交媒體分享太多個人資料"

#: - And Cyber Fraud HK.html:4512 HSBC Scams Security _
#: frontend/templates/Romance
msgid ""
"Scammers can easily piece together a story from the information you share"
" on your social media accounts and target you with social engineering "
"attacks."
msgstr "以免騙徒用「社交工程」技倆哄您上當。"

#: - And Cyber Fraud HK.html:4517 HSBC Scams Security _
#: frontend/templates/Romance
msgid "Keep your guard up if the excuses start pouring in"
msgstr "諸多推搪要小心"

#: - And Cyber Fraud HK.html:4520 HSBC Scams Security _
#: frontend/templates/Romance
msgid ""
"Are you starting to receive lots of excuses from your online lover about "
"why they can't turn on their webcam or meet you in person? That's a huge "
"red flag. Stay alert."
msgstr "如果「網上伴侶」總是不和您見面，必須警覺。"

#: - And Cyber Fraud HK.html:4525 HSBC Scams Security _
#: frontend/templates/Romance
msgid "Don't reveal anything about your finances"
msgstr "不要告訴別人您的財務狀况"

#: - And Cyber Fraud HK.html:4528 HSBC Scams Security _
#: frontend/templates/Romance
msgid ""
"If they start asking about your finances or asking for money, you should "
"be cautious."
msgstr "當對方詢問您的財務狀况，甚至要求您匯錢時，就要特別小心。"

#: - And Cyber Fraud HK.html:4533 HSBC Scams Security _
#: frontend/templates/Romance
msgid "Don't blindly trust information they provide"
msgstr "不要輕易相信他們提供的資料"

#: - And Cyber Fraud HK.html:4536 HSBC Scams Security _
#: frontend/templates/Romance
msgid ""
"The photos or selfies they've sent you might be fake, so it's best to do "
"your own verification. Use an app or go online to reverse image search "
"what they sent you. The back story of their lives could also be made up. "
"Ask questions and do your own research to check the details."
msgstr "有圖未必有真相，您可以在網上以圖搜圖，確認照片真假。您也可以試探對方，查證對方的背景資料是否屬實。"

#: - And Cyber Fraud HK.html:4546 HSBC Scams Security _
#: frontend/templates/Romance
msgid ""
"Love scammers are well-versed at their art of deception and know exactly "
"how to tug at your heartstrings. Don't let their sweet talk lure you into"
" handing over your money, bank details or other personal data."
msgstr "網上情緣騙徒善於牽動您的情緒，令您不能自拔，花言巧語千萬不要信以為真。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:9 HSBC _ and before checklist departure fraud
#: frontend/templates/Security next security travel your
msgid ""
"Security checklist before your next travel departure | Cyber security and"
" fraud - HSBC HK"
msgstr "旅遊有清單，保安一樣有"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4411 HSBC _ and before checklist departure fraud
#: frontend/templates/Security next security travel your
msgid ""
"Hongkongers are a travel loving bunch, spending a whopping USD25.5 "
"billion on international tourism"
msgstr "香港人熱愛旅遊，2017年在赴日本、泰國和澳洲等熱門地點的國際旅游上花費的金額高達255億美元"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4427 HSBC _ and before checklist departure fraud
#: frontend/templates/Security next security travel your
msgid "1. Pre-flight checks"
msgstr "1. 起飛前檢查"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4437 HSBC _ and before checklist departure fraud
#: frontend/templates/Security next security travel your
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"We're not just talking about keeping your window shades up or your seats "
"upright before the plane takes off; it's important to ensure your "
"smartphones and laptops have up-to-date operating systems and apps. These"
" fraud prevention security measures are the first step in"
msgstr "我們說的不是要在起飛前打開窗戶擋板，或者把座位豎直，而是要檢查手機和手提電腦是否已經安裝最新的作業系統和應用程式。這項預防欺詐的保安措施是"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4438 HSBC _ and before checklist departure fraud
#: frontend/templates/Security next security travel your
msgid "guarding against malware"
msgstr "抵禦惡意程式"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4440 HSBC _ and before checklist departure fraud
#: frontend/templates/Security next security travel your
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Once you've got that covered, consider the extra measure of ditching your"
" physical token and"
msgstr "您也可以由實體編碼器"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4441 HSBC _ and before checklist departure fraud
#: frontend/templates/Security next security travel your
msgid "switching to a Mobile Security Key"
msgstr "轉用流動保安編碼"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4448 HSBC _ and before checklist departure fraud
#: frontend/templates/Security next security travel your
msgid "2. Lock it down"
msgstr "2. 將智能裝置上鎖"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4459 HSBC _ and before checklist departure fraud
#: frontend/templates/Security next security travel your
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Keep your digital devices – smartphones, laptops, tablets, and your "
"security device – locked and secure with a password, fingerprint or "
"facial ID at all times. Strengthen your mobile security by shortening the"
" time your smartphone's auto lock mechanism takes to kick in, so "
"strangers have less of a chance to grab hold of your mobile's active "
"screen and apps."
msgstr "將智能電話、手提電腦、平板電腦和保安裝置等數碼裝置上鎖，時刻以密碼、指紋或臉部辨識作防護。我們也建議您縮短自動上鎖的時限，令陌生人有較少機會操作您的手機屏幕和應用程式，加強流動保安。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4463 HSBC _ and before checklist departure fraud
#: frontend/templates/Security next security travel your
msgid ""
"Better yet: never leave your devices unattended. Keep them in your "
"possession at all times, or safely secured in your hotel safe."
msgstr "更加有效的方法是︰不要將裝置放在您的視線範圍以外，應該時刻看管您的裝置，或將它放在酒店的保險箱內，確保安全。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4470 HSBC _ and before checklist departure fraud
#: frontend/templates/Security next security travel your
msgid "3. Keep your passwords private and strong"
msgstr "3. 採用難以識破的私人密碼"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4481 HSBC _ and before checklist departure fraud
#: frontend/templates/Security next security travel your
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Personal data protection is pivotal. Never share the passwords or pin "
"numbers for your devices, credit cards or debit cards with anyone. And "
"don't save those passwords on your device either, or write them on post-"
"its or notepads. Use a different password for each device, and don't use "
"your online banking password for anything else. Choose one that will be "
"easy for you to remember, but don't make it a normal word or phrase and "
"don't use things that are associated with you, such as pet names, "
"children’s names or the city you live in. Instead, use a (seemingly) "
"random combination of at least eight letters (both upper and lower case),"
" numbers and symbols. It might look like hieroglyphics to a stranger, but"
" it could hold a special meaning for you so you can easily remember it. "
"Need some inspiration?"
msgstr "保護個人資料最為關鍵，不要告訴別人任何裝置、信用卡或扣賬卡的密碼或PIN碼，也不應把密碼儲存在自己的裝置內，或者將它寫在便利貼或記事本內。為每個裝置設定不同的密碼，也不要將網上理財密碼用在其他裝置上。您可以使用容易記得的密碼，但不要使用一般單字或短語，也不要用您的個人資料作密碼，例如寵物的名字、乳名或居住的城市等。您可以使用看似隨機的組合，以字母（大寫和小寫）、數字和符號組成密碼。對不知道箇中含義的人來說，這個組合可能有如「外星文字」，但對您卻有特別意義，方便記憶。不知道從何入手？"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4483 HSBC _ and before checklist departure fraud
#: frontend/templates/Security next security travel your
msgid "We've got some tips on how to create a strong password."
msgstr "不妨參考我們關於建立安全密碼的建議？"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4491 HSBC _ and before checklist departure fraud
#: frontend/templates/Security next security travel your
msgid "4. Be wary of public Wi-Fi and Bluetooth"
msgstr "4. 慎用公共Wi-Fi和藍牙"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4502 HSBC _ and before checklist departure fraud
#: frontend/templates/Security next security travel your
msgid ""
"While it's tempting to connect to any free Wi-Fi network you can find "
"instead of purchasing a local data plan for your smartphone, this can "
"pose a security threat to your personal data, especially if you use "
"unencrypted networks. This is true even if you're just checking your "
"email or social media. If you must use the hotel Wi-Fi platform to get "
"online, avoid accessing any sites or data that contain or require your "
"personal information."
msgstr ""
"免費Wi-"
"Fi可以省下當地數據計劃費用，無疑非常方便，卻會威脅您的個人資料安全。而使用未經加密的網絡，就更加危險。即使您只是用來檢查電郵、使用社交媒體，仍然有機會洩露個人資料"
"。但如果您必須用酒店的Wi-Fi上網，應該避免到訪任何包含或要求您提供個人資料的網站或資訊。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4506 HSBC _ and before checklist departure fraud
#: frontend/templates/Security next security travel your
msgid ""
"Some venues actively look for devices with Wi-Fi or Bluetooth turned on "
"so they can track your movements while you are within range. To avoid "
"this, disable your Wi-Fi and Bluetooth when you're not using them."
msgstr "有些場所會主動搜尋啟用Wi-Fi或藍牙功能的裝置，在收發範圍內記錄您的行蹤。為了避免這種情況，在不使用Wi-Fi或藍牙功能時，就應該將它們關掉。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4513 HSBC _ and before checklist departure fraud
#: frontend/templates/Security next security travel your
msgid "5. Keep sensitive information off public channels"
msgstr "5. 避免以公共途徑傳送敏感資料料"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4524 HSBC _ and before checklist departure fraud
#: frontend/templates/Security next security travel your
msgid ""
"If you have to use the computer, printer or phone at your hotel's "
"business centre, make sure you're not using them to communicate sensitive"
" information or private data. Anytime you sign in to an account on a "
"public computer, make sure that you don't allow the site or the browser "
"to save your log-in details. You never know who will be using the "
"computer afterwards. Once you're finished, log off completely from all "
"the pages you opened, especially if you've had to access your bank or "
"email accounts."
msgstr "如果需要使用酒店商務中心的電腦、打印機或電話，不要用它們傳送敏感資料或私人資訊。在公用電腦登入賬戶前，應先確保這些網站或瀏覽器不會儲存自己的登入資訊，因為您不會知道接著誰會使用這部電腦。用完之後，徹底登出所有頁面，特別是銀行或電郵賬戶。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4531 HSBC _ and before checklist departure fraud
#: frontend/templates/Security next security travel your
msgid "6. Check the ATMs"
msgstr "6. 檢查自動櫃員機"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4542 HSBC _ and before checklist departure fraud
#: frontend/templates/Security next security travel your
msgid ""
"If you have to use an ATM during your trip, take a second look before "
"sliding in your bank card. In recent years we've seen scams like shell "
"ATMs being set up to look exactly like the real thing, or ATM skimmers – "
"malicious card readers – being attached to actual ATMs. If you put your "
"bank card into one of those, it's not cash that comes out, but your card "
"data and PIN – and it goes straight into the hands of the fraudsters."
msgstr "如果旅程中要使用自動櫃員機，在插入銀行卡前，應該仔細看看櫃員機。近年，有不法分子在自動櫃員機裝設十分像真的「空殼機」，又曾在櫃員機加裝讀卡器。當您把銀行卡插入「空殼機」或讀卡器時，騙徒就能知道卡上的資料和PIN碼。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4546 HSBC _ and before checklist departure fraud
#: frontend/templates/Security next security travel your
msgid ""
"Even if an ATM looks legitimate and is branded as that of a reputable "
"bank you recognise, check for signs that it might be a fake. Does the pin"
" shield detach easily from the machine? Are there two slots instead of "
"just one insert your card into the machine? Are the arrows directing you "
"to insert your card positioned oddly and does the keypad feel strange to "
"the touch? Does any part of the ATM look like it's been tampered with and"
" does it look different from the machine next to it? If so, don't use it."
msgstr ""

#: - Cyber HK.html:4549 HSBC _ and before checklist departure fraud
#: frontend/templates/Security next security travel your
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Your safest bet is to use an ATM in a branch, during bank hours. That "
"way, if the machine eats your card, you'll be able to talk to bank staff "
"about getting it back immediately. If that happens at a different ATM, "
"you'll need to call our customer support hotline and let us know, but you"
" might be without your card for the rest of your trip."
msgstr "最安全的做法，莫過於在銀行營業時間內使用分行的自動櫃員機。即使櫃員機「食卡」，也可以請職員即時取回您的銀行卡。如果您在使用其他自動櫃員機時「食卡」，就要致電我們的客戶服務熱線，但您就未必可以在旅程期間取回銀行卡了。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4552 HSBC _ and before checklist departure fraud
#: frontend/templates/Security next security travel your
msgid ""
"Even if you are certain the ATM you're using is legitimate, there is one "
"more danger to be aware of: peepers. People – or strategically placed "
"cameras – who hope to spy on you as you enter that magic PIN on the "
"keypad. Keep your wits about you when using any ATM and do your best to "
"hide your fingers so no one can figure out your PIN."
msgstr "然而，即使您肯定所用的自動櫃員機毫無問題，仍然需要提防那些偷看的人。不法分子或者裝在「有利」位置的鏡頭，可能會偷看您輸入銀行卡密碼。所以使用自動櫃員機時，應該提高警覺，盡量遮掩輸入的動作，令其他人看不到您的密碼。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4554 HSBC _ and before checklist departure fraud
#: frontend/templates/Security next security travel your
msgid "Find out more about staying safe at the ATM."
msgstr "不妨了解一下安全使用自動櫃員機陷阱的方法。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4562 HSBC _ and before checklist departure fraud
#: frontend/templates/Security next security travel your
msgid "7. Keep track of your belongings"
msgstr "7. 保管好隨身物品"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4573 HSBC _ and before checklist departure fraud
#: frontend/templates/Security next security travel your
msgid ""
"Make sure you keep your personal belongings accounted for while "
"travelling, especially when you're on the move between different cities. "
"It's not a good idea to keep your cash, credit or debit cards, laptop, "
"cellphone and passport all in the same place, because you might be left "
"completely stranded in the unfortunate event of being pick-pocketed, "
"while the perpetrator has access to even more of your private "
"information. Keep your guard up especially in crowded areas or during "
"times when you may be momentarily distracted, like when you're having a "
"meal with a large group of people or shopping in a crowded market."
msgstr "記得在旅程時刻保管好個人財物，特別是在不同城市之間穿梭時，更加要小心。最好不要把現金、信用卡、扣賬卡、手提電腦、手機和護照放在同一個地方。如果不幸遇上扒手，您可能會損失慘重，也會讓扒手一下取得您更多私人資料。在人多擠迫的地方，或可能會分心時（例如與大夥進餐或者在熱鬧的市場購物），一定要打醒十二分精神。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4580 HSBC _ and before checklist departure fraud
#: frontend/templates/Security next security travel your
msgid "8. One last step"
msgstr "8. 旅途結尾"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4591 HSBC _ and before checklist departure fraud
#: frontend/templates/Security next security travel your
msgid ""
"The cybersecurity checklist doesn't end right when you board your return "
"flight back. If you used local networks or Wi-Fi while you were overseas,"
" your cellphone and laptop could be carrying spyware you're not aware of."
" Once you get home, update your security and antivirus software to the "
"newest available versions, and change your device passwords."
msgstr ""
"踏上回程客機，不代表網上保安已經完成。如果您在海外用過當地網絡或Wi-"
"Fi，間諜軟件可能已經潛藏在您的手機和手提電腦之中。回家後，應盡快把保安和防毒軟件更新至最新版本，並更改裝置的密碼。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4595 HSBC _ and before checklist departure fraud
#: frontend/templates/Security next security travel your
msgid ""
"We hope these tips will help keep you safe both at home and abroad. Each "
"of the tips might protect something small, but the more you can protect, "
"the fewer ways a cyber criminal will have of patching together your "
"identity or committing a fraud."
msgstr "希望這些錦囊能夠幫您確保境內和境外的網絡安全。只使用一個錦囊，保護未必足夠，但如果多管齊下，就可以保護更多資料，令網上犯罪分子更難掌握您的身分資訊、製造騙局。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4597 HSBC _ and before checklist departure fraud
#: frontend/templates/Security next security travel your
msgid ""
"We've got lots of other tips that can help you maximise your banking "
"security."
msgstr "我們還有許多其他建議，幫您更加安全地理財。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4600 HSBC _ and before checklist departure fraud
#: frontend/templates/Security next security travel your
msgid "Planning a trip?"
msgstr "正在計劃旅程？"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4602 HSBC _ and before checklist departure fraud
#: frontend/templates/Security next security travel your
msgid "Check out our other safe travel tips."
msgstr "不妨看看我們其他的安全旅遊訣竅。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4619 HSBC _ and before checklist departure fraud
#: frontend/templates/Security next security travel your
#, fuzzy
msgid "Source:"
msgstr "資料來源："

#: - Cyber HK.html:4622 HSBC _ and before checklist departure fraud
#: frontend/templates/Security next security travel your
msgid "Media Outreach"
msgstr "Media Outreach"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4694 HSBC _ and before checklist departure fraud
#: frontend/templates/Security next security travel your
#, fuzzy
msgid "Back To Top"
msgstr "返回頁首"

#: - And Aware HK.html:9 HSBC Instagram Of Scams WhatsApp
#: frontend/templates/Stay
msgid "Stay Aware Of WhatsApp And Instagram Scams - HSBC HK"
msgstr "提防WhatsApp騙案Instagram騙案 - 香港滙豐"

#: - And Aware HK.html:4409 HSBC Instagram Of Scams WhatsApp
#: frontend/templates/Stay
msgid ""
"Fraudsters are infiltrating popular messaging platforms such as WhatsApp "
"and Instagram (IG). Find out how to protect yourself."
msgstr "網絡罪犯透過WhatsApp、Instagram（IG）等熱門通訊應用程式進行詐騙。知己知彼，了解如何保障自己。"

#: - And Aware HK.html:4416 HSBC Instagram Of Scams WhatsApp
#: frontend/templates/Stay
msgid ""
"WhatsApp hackers can access your account without you knowing and use it "
"to send payment requests to people on your contact list. Those who "
"receive the message might believe it came from you and be likely to "
"follow the instructions."
msgstr "騙徒在您不知情的情況下騎劫您的WhatsApp帳戶，然後向在您通訊錄上的親友發出轉賬請求，收到訊息的親友因誤信您有財務需要，繼而被騙去金錢。"

#: - And Aware HK.html:4419 HSBC Instagram Of Scams WhatsApp
#: frontend/templates/Stay
msgid ""
"This tactic has spread to IG and other social networking platforms with "
"in-app chats. So, stay cautious on all forms of messaging and social "
"networking platforms to avoid scams."
msgstr "這種WhatsApp詐騙手法已蔓延至IG等其他有即時通訊功能的社交媒體平台，所以在使用任何通訊軟件或社交媒體平台時都要格外留神，慎防受騙！"

#: - And Aware HK.html:4426 HSBC Instagram Of Scams WhatsApp
#: frontend/templates/Stay
msgid "How fraudsters can hijack your account"
msgstr "騙徒騎劫帳戶手法"

#: - And Aware HK.html:4436 HSBC Instagram Of Scams WhatsApp
#: frontend/templates/Stay
msgid ""
"Fraudsters could send messages claiming that your account has violated "
"the user agreement, or that your account is at risk. They'd then lure you"
" with a fake customer service phishing link or a contact number that "
"connects you to fraudsters. This is to get your verification code that "
"they have requested. Or, they might simply ask for it by sending you "
"another message."
msgstr "不法之徒會向您發出訊息，訛稱您的帳戶有違規行為或存在風險，並傳送偽造的客戶服務連結，或同黨的電話號碼，以套取由他們發出請求的驗證碼，或再次向您發出訊息索取。"

#: - And Aware HK.html:4441 HSBC Instagram Of Scams WhatsApp
#: frontend/templates/Stay
msgid ""
"They will then try to log in to your account with your phone number and a"
" verification code on their own devices."
msgstr "然後，騙徒會在自己的裝置輸入您的電話號碼和驗證碼，試圖登入您的帳戶。"

#: - And Aware HK.html:4446 HSBC Instagram Of Scams WhatsApp
#: frontend/templates/Stay
msgid ""
"Finally, you'll be asked to confirm their login attempt as genuine to "
"gain full access to your account."
msgstr "最後，騙徒會要求您認證他們的登入，從而騎劫您的帳戶。"

#: - And Aware HK.html:4458 HSBC Instagram Of Scams WhatsApp
#: frontend/templates/Stay
msgid ""
"After that, the fraudsters send messages to your contacts asking for "
"money for various reasons. As the messages are from a trusted account "
"(yours!), recipients often comply and send the fraudsters money."
msgstr "成功騎劫帳戶後，騙徒會向您通訊錄上的親友以不同原因索取金錢，親友會誤以為訊息來自可靠的帳戶（您的帳戶），繼而墜入金錢騙局。"

#: - And Aware HK.html:4465 HSBC Instagram Of Scams WhatsApp
#: frontend/templates/Stay
msgid "How to avoid your accounts being hijacked"
msgstr "如何防止帳戶被盜用"

#: - And Aware HK.html:4472 HSBC Instagram Of Scams WhatsApp
#: frontend/templates/Stay
msgid "1. Strengthen your security settings"
msgstr "1.&nbsp;加強保安設定"

#: - And Aware HK.html:4479 HSBC Instagram Of Scams WhatsApp
#: frontend/templates/Stay
msgid ""
"Enable the two-factor authentication (2FA) feature on WhatsApp, IG and "
"other messaging apps. This enhances the security of your accounts as two "
"steps are required to log in."
msgstr "在WhatsApp、IG或其他通訊軟件開啟雙重驗證（2FA）功能後，用戶就需要兩個驗證步驟才能登入，大大加強賬戶安全。"

#: - And Aware HK.html:4482 HSBC Instagram Of Scams WhatsApp
#: frontend/templates/Stay
msgid "Never share your PIN or one-time password with others."
msgstr "緊記切勿向其他人透露PIN碼或一次性密碼。"

#: - And Aware HK.html:4489 HSBC Instagram Of Scams WhatsApp
#: frontend/templates/Stay
msgid "2. Protect your sensitive personal information"
msgstr "2.&nbsp;小心保護敏感個人資料"

#: - And Aware HK.html:4496 HSBC Instagram Of Scams WhatsApp
#: frontend/templates/Stay
msgid ""
"Never share your sensitive personal information, including digital "
"banking credentials, PINs or one-time passwords with others. Your money "
"may be at risk if fraudsters get hold of the information."
msgstr "切勿透露自己的敏感個人資料，包括網上理財登入資料、PIN碼或一次性密碼。若騙徒取得相關資料，您就有可能蒙受金錢損失。"

#: - And Aware HK.html:4499 HSBC Instagram Of Scams WhatsApp
#: frontend/templates/Stay
msgid ""
"Stay vigilant when you're asked for sensitive information, even if you're"
" chatting with someone you know. There's always a chance their account or"
" device has been hijacked."
msgstr "如果有人發訊息向您索取敏感資料，即使對方是您認識的人，也必須保持警惕，因為對方的帳戶或裝置可能已被盜用。"

#: - And Aware HK.html:4506 HSBC Instagram Of Scams WhatsApp
#: frontend/templates/Stay
msgid "3. Beware of suspicious links and attachments"
msgstr "3. 避免點擊可疑的連結或附件"

#: - And Aware HK.html:4513 HSBC Instagram Of Scams WhatsApp
#: frontend/templates/Stay
msgid ""
"Don't click on any links or download attachments that look suspicious – "
"even if the message appears to be from someone you know. Always check if "
"the source is trustworthy before taking any action."
msgstr "不要隨意點擊訊息中的連結或下載附件，就算訊息是由熟人發出，您都應在點擊前仔細查清楚連結是否安全可靠。"

#: - And Aware HK.html:4521 HSBC Instagram Of Scams WhatsApp
#: frontend/templates/Stay
msgid ""
"You will never receive a hyperlink from your bank that asks you to input "
"any sensitive personal information."
msgstr "銀行絕對不會向您發出連結要求您輸入任何敏感個人資料。"

#: - And Aware HK.html:4529 HSBC Instagram Of Scams WhatsApp
#: frontend/templates/Stay
msgid "4. Learn about your apps and keep them updated"
msgstr "4.&nbsp;多了解您使用的通訊軟件並定期更新"

#: - And Aware HK.html:4536 HSBC Instagram Of Scams WhatsApp
#: frontend/templates/Stay
msgid ""
"Make sure you know about the apps you use. For example, WhatsApp states "
"that it'll never ask you to:"
msgstr "應確保自己對使用中的通訊軟件有足夠了解。以WhatsApp安全風險為例，官方網站表明絕不會要求用戶："

#: - And Aware HK.html:4548 HSBC Instagram Of Scams WhatsApp
#: frontend/templates/Stay
msgid "Download any other apps or systems"
msgstr "下載額外軟件或系統"

#: - And Aware HK.html:4553 HSBC Instagram Of Scams WhatsApp
#: frontend/templates/Stay
msgid "Tap a link, either to go to another website, or to activate a new service"
msgstr "點擊連結以前往另一網站或啟動新服務"

#: - And Aware HK.html:4558 HSBC Instagram Of Scams WhatsApp
#: frontend/templates/Stay
msgid "Pay for their service"
msgstr "支付服務費"

#: - And Aware HK.html:4563 HSBC Instagram Of Scams WhatsApp
#: frontend/templates/Stay
msgid "Forward a message"
msgstr "轉寄訊息"

#: - And Aware HK.html:4573 HSBC Instagram Of Scams WhatsApp
#: frontend/templates/Stay
msgid ""
"Meanwhile, IG's security checkup feature helps you find out whether your "
"account is secure."
msgstr "IG則設「帳戶安全檢查」助您檢查資料，保障帳戶安全。"

#: - And Aware HK.html:4576 HSBC Instagram Of Scams WhatsApp
#: frontend/templates/Stay
msgid ""
"Always check for app updates on your mobile device. Keeping your apps "
"updated can fix bugs and improve security."
msgstr "通訊軟件會定期修復程式和提升保安功能，所以應時常更新軟件，使用最新版本的應用程式可以堵塞漏洞。"

#: - And Aware HK.html:4583 HSBC Instagram Of Scams WhatsApp
#: frontend/templates/Stay
msgid "5. Verify through phone call"
msgstr "5.&nbsp;致電親友查證"

#: - And Aware HK.html:4590 HSBC Instagram Of Scams WhatsApp
#: frontend/templates/Stay
msgid ""
"If you receive a message from family or friends asking for any form of "
"financial assistance, always call them to confirm before doing anything. "
"If the bank account holder name doesn't look right, be extra careful "
"before sending any money."
msgstr "當收到親友訊息，要求您提供任何形式的經濟援助時，應先打電話給他們問清楚。如果銀行戶口持有人姓名不尋常，就要格外留神，切勿輕易轉賬給對方。"

#: - And Aware HK.html:4593 HSBC Instagram Of Scams WhatsApp
#: frontend/templates/Stay
msgid ""
"Use the Hong Kong Police Force's Scameter or Scameter+ app to verify "
"suspicious numbers, emails, bank accounts and so on."
msgstr "您亦可運用香港警方的「防騙視伏器」或「防騙視伏App」應用程式評估可疑電話號碼、電郵、銀行戶口等的風險。"

#: - And Aware HK.html:4600 HSBC Instagram Of Scams WhatsApp
#: frontend/templates/Stay
msgid "Be aware – whatever, whenever and wherever"
msgstr "時刻提高警覺"

#: - And Aware HK.html:4606 HSBC Instagram Of Scams WhatsApp
#: frontend/templates/Stay
msgid ""
"Staying vigilant at all times can protect you and help fight fraud. If in"
" doubt, call the police's Anti-Deception Coordination Centre (ADCC) "
"hotline at"
msgstr "任何時候都應小心提防騙子，識破詐騙保障自己。如有懷疑，可致電警方的反詐騙協調中心「防騙易」熱線。"

#: - And Aware HK.html:4614 HSBC Instagram Of Scams WhatsApp
#: frontend/templates/Stay
msgid ""
"HSBC is committed to protecting your financial security. Think you might "
"have come across a WhatsApp scam or Instagram scam? Please contact us at:"
msgstr "滙豐致力保障您的財務安全。懷疑自己遭遇WhatsApp騙案或Instagram騙案？請即聯絡我們："

#: - HK.html:9 HSBC Registration SMS Scheme Sender _phishing_ and
#: frontend/templates/What is
msgid "What is \"phishing\" and SMS Sender Registration Scheme - HSBC HK"
msgstr "甚麼是「網絡釣魚」及短訊發送人登記制 - 香港滙豐"

#: - HK.html:4313 HSBC Registration SMS Scheme Sender _phishing_ and
#: frontend/templates/What is
msgid ""
"Online criminals are after your money. Here are some ways to help protect"
" yourself"
msgstr "網上匪徒對您的金錢虎視眈眈，以下羅列一些自我保護的方法"

#: - HK.html:4395 HSBC Registration SMS Scheme Sender _phishing_ and
#: frontend/templates/What is
msgid "What is phishing?"
msgstr "何謂「網絡釣魚」？"

#: - HK.html:4402 HSBC Registration SMS Scheme Sender _phishing_ and
#: frontend/templates/What is
msgid ""
"Phishing is when a criminal sends you an email, SMS or phone call "
"pretending to be from a legitimate organisation, such as a bank, online "
"payment service, online retailer, or even a government department. They "
"will often look very similar to genuine communications from these "
"organisations. The communication will aim to get you to divulge passwords"
" / bank details or other personal information by asking you click "
"embedded links, scan QR codes or download attached files to implant "
"malware on your device."
msgstr "進行「網絡釣魚」(phishing)的騙徒會冒充合法機構，如銀行、網上付款服務商、網上零售商或政府機構，向您發送電郵、短訊或來電，看來亦往往與這些公司發出的真正訊息相似。這些訊息意圖透過要求您點擊內嵌連結、掃描QR碼或下載可在您的裝置植入惡意軟件的檔案附件，從而使獲取您的密碼、銀行資料或其他個人資料。"

#: - HK.html:4405 HSBC Registration SMS Scheme Sender _phishing_ and
#: frontend/templates/What is
msgid ""
"Besides, the embedded links will take you to a website that also looks "
"very similar to the organisation's genuine site. Once you arrive at the "
"fake site, it will usually prompt you to enter sensitive personal "
"information, such as your account number, PIN, security code or one-time "
"passwords (OTPs). The phishing site records everything you enter, and "
"then the criminal can use your information to log into your actual "
"account and steal your money."
msgstr "此外，內嵌連結會將您帶至與有關機構真實網站極度相似的網站。一旦接達仿冒網站，受害人通常會被提示輸入敏感個人資料，如戶口號碼、PIN碼、保安編碼或一次性密碼。「網絡釣魚」網站會記錄所輸入的一切資料，騙徒繼而藉此登入您的賬戶及盜取金錢。"

#: - HK.html:4408 HSBC Registration SMS Scheme Sender _phishing_ and
#: frontend/templates/What is
msgid ""
"Recently criminals may encourage you to redeem special offers on social "
"media platforms by clicking on suspicious link or installing app on your "
"device. While this application may look and act like something useful "
"(for example a shopping application), it may in fact contain malware that"
" allow the criminals to control your phone and/or capture sensitive data."
msgstr "最近，騙徒於社交媒體平台上以提供特別優惠為由，誘使客戶點擊可疑連結或下戴應用程式。這些應用程式可能含有惡意軟件，讓騙徒得以操控您的手機及/或獲取敏感資料。"

#: - HK.html:4413 HSBC Registration SMS Scheme Sender _phishing_ and
#: frontend/templates/What is
msgid "To spot a phishing attempt, ask yourself the following questions:"
msgstr "在判斷某電郵 / 短訊是否屬「網絡釣魚」時，應思考下列問題："

#: - HK.html:4495 HSBC Registration SMS Scheme Sender _phishing_ and
#: frontend/templates/What is
msgid "How can I tell if I'm being phished?"
msgstr "如何確定是否遇到「網絡釣魚」？"

#: - HK.html:4501 HSBC Registration SMS Scheme Sender _phishing_ and
#: frontend/templates/What is
msgid ""
"<strong>\n"
"                                                                Fake or "
"fraudulent websites:\n"
"                                                            </strong>"
msgstr ""

#: - HK.html:4555 HSBC Registration SMS Scheme Sender _phishing_ and
#: frontend/templates/What is
msgid "See some examples of phishing SMSes"
msgstr "看看以下「網絡釣魚」短訊的真實案例："

#: - HK.html:4569 HSBC Registration SMS Scheme Sender _phishing_ and
#: frontend/templates/What is
msgid ""
"These are real phishing SMSes received by our customers, most of which "
"are in English. As you can see, these fraudulent messages usually put "
"your private information at risk. As a rule of thumb, you should always "
"be extra vigilant when you receive SMSes of such nature!"
msgstr "以下截圖為我們客戶收到的偽冒手機短訊，其中大部分是英文短訊，企圖令您的個人資料外洩，如收到此類短訊，請保持警惕！"

#: - HK.html:4715 HSBC Registration SMS Scheme Sender _phishing_ and
#: frontend/templates/What is
#, fuzzy
msgid "See some examples of phishing emails"
msgstr "看看以下「網絡釣魚」短訊的真實案例："

#: - HK.html:4728 HSBC Registration SMS Scheme Sender _phishing_ and
#: frontend/templates/What is
msgid ""
"<strong>\n"
""
"                                                                                    "
"This is a real phishing email received by our customers, which is also in"
" English. Always remember:\n"
""
"                                                                                "
"</strong>"
msgstr ""

#: - HK.html:4782 HK.html:4816 HK.html:4850 HK.html:4884 HSBC Registration SMS
#: Scheme Sender _phishing_ and frontend/templates/What is
msgid "Read the"
msgstr "查閲有關偽冒電郵的"

#: - HK.html:4784 HK.html:4818 HK.html:4852 HK.html:4886 HSBC Registration SMS
#: Scheme Sender _phishing_ and frontend/templates/What is
msgid "official press release"
msgstr "官方新聞稿"

#: - HK.html:4912 HSBC Registration SMS Scheme Sender _phishing_ and
#: frontend/templates/What is
msgid "How to protect yourself from phishing"
msgstr "如何從「網絡釣魚」中保護自己?"

#: - HK.html:4919 HSBC Registration SMS Scheme Sender _phishing_ and
#: frontend/templates/What is
msgid "Follow these tips to prevent falling prey to phishing:"
msgstr "請遵循以下提示，以防墜入「網路釣魚」陷阱："

#: - HK.html:4958 HSBC Registration SMS Scheme Sender _phishing_ and
#: frontend/templates/What is
msgid "What should I do if I'm being phished?"
msgstr "遇上「網絡釣魚」，應該怎樣處理？"

#: - HK.html:4964 HSBC Registration SMS Scheme Sender _phishing_ and
#: frontend/templates/What is
msgid ""
"If an email,SMS or call seems suspicious, don’t reply to it. Don't click "
"on any links. Don't open any attachments. We would never send you any "
"messages with a link requesting that you log on to online banking or "
"provide your usernames and passwords. And if you do receive a message "
"claiming to be from HSBC and asking you to provide your account "
"credentials or sensitive personal information, report it to us via:"
msgstr "如果您收到可疑的電郵或短訊，切勿回覆、點擊任何連結或開啟任何附件。我們絕對不會透過訊息内的連結要求您登入網上理財或提供登入賬號及密碼。若您收到自稱是滙豐發出的訊息，要求您提供戶口資料或敏感的個人資料，請即電郵至"

#: - HK.html:4965 HSBC Registration SMS Scheme Sender _phishing_ and
#: frontend/templates/What is
msgid "Phishing@hsbc.com"
msgstr ""

#: - HK.html:4968 HSBC Registration SMS Scheme Sender _phishing_ and
#: frontend/templates/What is
msgid ""
"If you believe you have disclosed account credentials or sensitive "
"personal information to a fraudster, please report it to us via our "
"customer service hotlines immediately:"
msgstr "如您相信已向騙徒提供賬戶憑證或敏感個人資料，請即致電客戶服務熱線向我們回報:"

#: - HK.html:5013 HSBC Registration SMS Scheme Sender _phishing_ and
#: frontend/templates/What is
msgid "SMS Sender Registration Scheme"
msgstr "短訊發送人登記制"

#: - HK.html:5020 HSBC Registration SMS Scheme Sender _phishing_ and
#: frontend/templates/What is
msgid ""
"To assist public in identifying SMS sender and prevent them from falling "
"prey to phishing SMS, Office of the Communications Authority, the Hong "
"Kong Monetary Authority, the Hong Kong Police Force, the Hong Kong "
"Association of Banks and the telecommunications industry have established"
" the “SMS Sender Registration Scheme”. Starting from 28"
msgstr ""

#: - HK.html:5033 HK.html:5101 HSBC Registration SMS Scheme Sender _phishing_
#: and frontend/templates/What is
msgid ""
"Starting from 28th January 2024, the sender address of one-time SMS sent "
"by HSBC will be replaced by the registered sender IDs below:"
msgstr "由2024年1月28日起，滙豐發送之一次性短訊，發送者地址將會以指定登記發送人名稱取代現有之號碼："

#: - HK.html:5043 HK.html:5116 HK.html:5147 HK.html:5178 HK.html:5209 HSBC
#: Registration SMS Scheme Sender _phishing_ and frontend/templates/What is
msgid "Sender ID"
msgstr "發送人名稱"

#: - HK.html:5046 HK.html:5124 HK.html:5155 HK.html:5186 HK.html:5217 HSBC
#: Registration SMS Scheme Sender _phishing_ and frontend/templates/What is
msgid "SMS Type"
msgstr "短訊類別"

#: - HK.html:5229 HSBC Registration SMS Scheme Sender _phishing_ and
#: frontend/templates/What is
msgid "Please note that the SMS Sender Registration Scheme is not appliable to:"
msgstr "請注意，短訊發送人登記制並不適用於:"

#: - HK.html:5275 HSBC Registration SMS Scheme Sender _phishing_ and
#: frontend/templates/What is
msgid ""
"HSBC reminder: If you receive SMS from unknown sender, please be vigilant"
" and do not disclose any personal, account or credit card information, or"
" transfer money as per requested. Do not click on suspicious link in SMS."
" If in doubt, you can use \"Scameter\" or \"Scameter+\" launched by the "
"police to evaluate the fraud risk of suspicious SMS, emails or calls by "
"checking the phone number, email address or URL on the platform."
msgstr "滙豐提示：如收到陌生發送人的短訊，請提高警覺，不應披露任何個人、戶口或信用卡資料，又或按其要求轉賬金錢。切勿點擊可疑短訊內的連結，如有懷疑，可使用警方推出的「防騙視伏器」或「防騙視伏App」去查詢電話號、電郵地址或網址，以評估可疑短訊、電郵或來電的詐騙風險。"

#: - HK.html:5309 HSBC Registration SMS Scheme Sender _phishing_ and
#: frontend/templates/What is
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"In this digital age, it is important to keep your Personal Digital Keys "
"safe. They are your account credentials (eg online banking username and "
"password, one-time passcode, and credit card credentials) and other "
"sensitive personal information (eg your HKID number and date of birth). "
"Please keep them well-protected as you would do with the keys to your "
"home.  If fraudsters manage to steal such information, it could result in"
" financial loss. Remember to keep your Personal Digital Keys safe!"
msgstr "踏入電子時代，必須保護好您的個人數碼KEY，亦即您的戶口資料（例如網上理財的登入賬號及密碼、一次性密碼或信用卡資料）及敏感的個人資料（例如香港身份證號碼及出生日期）。個人數碼KEY如您的家門鎖匙一樣重要，必須好好保護，慎防不法之徒盜取這些資料，令您遭受財務損失。"

#: - HK.html:5311 HSBC Registration SMS Scheme Sender _phishing_ and
#: frontend/templates/What is
msgid "Learn more about other security tips on"
msgstr "了解更多網絡安全貼士，請前往"

#: - HK.html:5313 HSBC Registration SMS Scheme Sender _phishing_ and
#: frontend/templates/What is
msgid "HKMA website"
msgstr "香港金融管理局網站"

#: - Cyber HK.html:9 HSBC _ about and device fraud frontend/templates/What know
#: mobile need security settings to you
msgid ""
"What you need to know about mobile device settings | Cyber security and "
"fraud - HSBC HK"
msgstr "流動裝置設定您要知 | 網絡安全及防詐騙資訊 - 香港滙豐"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4330 HSBC _ about and device fraud frontend/templates/What
#: know mobile need security settings to you
msgid ""
"Your mobile contains a lot of valuable information. Don't let it fall "
"into the wrong hands. Here's how you can keep your mobile safe."
msgstr "您的流動裝置載有大量寶貴資料，應提防落入不法分子的手中。以下為保障裝置安全的守則。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4412 HSBC _ about and device fraud frontend/templates/What
#: know mobile need security settings to you
msgid ""
"The majority of online activity is done on mobile devices. That includes "
"browsing, communicating, posting on social media, as well as making "
"financial transactions. That’s why we need to treat our mobiles with the "
"same level of vigilance and cyber protection as we do our computers."
msgstr "大部分網上活動都在流動裝置進行，當中包括瀏覽、通訊、在社交媒體登載內容，以及進行財務交易。故此，我們對流動裝置的警覺及採取的網絡防護措施，均需達到和電腦同級的水平。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4420 HSBC _ about and device fraud frontend/templates/What
#: know mobile need security settings to you
msgid "How you can keep your mobile safe"
msgstr "如何安全地使用流動裝置"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4428 HSBC _ about and device fraud frontend/templates/What
#: know mobile need security settings to you
msgid "Browse smartly"
msgstr "做個精明瀏覽者"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4498 HSBC _ about and device fraud frontend/templates/What
#: know mobile need security settings to you
msgid ""
"<strong>\n"
"                                                Be cautious of using any "
"free VPN\n"
"                                            </strong>"
msgstr ""

#: - Cyber HK.html:4502 HSBC _ about and device fraud frontend/templates/What
#: know mobile need security settings to you
msgid ""
"A \"Virtual Private Network\", or VPN, is a software that allows you to "
"mask your computer's location or log on to sites as if your computer is "
"based in another country or region. But just as “there’s no such thing as"
" a free lunch”, the cheaper the VPN, the greater the chance they have "
"security issues."
msgstr ""
"「虛擬專用網絡」（Virtual Private "
"Network，簡稱VPN）是一種可用來隱藏電腦位址，或使電腦以看來處於另一國家或地區的「虛擬」位址登入網站的軟件。但「世上沒有免費午餐」：VPN越是廉宜，涉及保安問題的機會亦越高。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4505 HSBC _ about and device fraud frontend/templates/What
#: know mobile need security settings to you
msgid "Free VPNs have hidden dangers"
msgstr "免費VPN的隱藏危機"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4516 HSBC _ about and device fraud frontend/templates/What
#: know mobile need security settings to you
msgid ""
"If you really want to use VPN, it's important to use a paid VPN, or one "
"that has in-app purchase for higher levels of service. Paid doesn’t "
"guarantee secure, but even partially paid apps are often more protective "
"of your data and give more software updates than free options. Better "
"yet, stick with a reputable VPN made by well-known providers or "
"antivirus-software makers."
msgstr "如果真的要使用VPN，務必選用付費VPN，或可在應用程式內購買更高服務水平的VPN。付款固然不代表安全，但與免費的選擇相比，即使是部分付費的應用程式亦往往提供更佳的資料保護和更多的軟件更新。最理想的選擇，莫過於由知名供應商或防毒軟件廠商製作而具信譽的VPN。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4532 HSBC _ about and device fraud frontend/templates/What
#: know mobile need security settings to you
msgid ""
"<strong>\n"
"                                                Be vigilant if your "
"mobile is suddenly out of signal\n"
"                                            </strong>"
msgstr ""

#: - Cyber HK.html:4536 HSBC _ about and device fraud frontend/templates/What
#: know mobile need security settings to you
msgid ""
"With more people using mobile devices to do banking, fraudsters have "
"begun to use a technique known as a \"SIM-swap\"."
msgstr "隨着以流動裝置理財的人日漸增多，騙徒亦開始施展稱為「SIM卡偷換」的技巧。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4539 HSBC _ about and device fraud frontend/templates/What
#: know mobile need security settings to you
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Basically the criminal will call your mobile service provider claiming to"
" be you, and ask for a replacement SIM card, saying that they lost the "
"SIM or phone. If they are convincing, the mobile service provider will "
"deactivate your SIM and issues a new one to the fraudster, who then "
"executes transactions that require OTP authorisations."
msgstr "簡單來說，匪徒會訛稱是受害人本人而致電流動服務供應商，稱自己遺失SIM卡或電話並且想補領SIM卡。若他博得職員相任，服務供應商便會停用受害人的SIM卡並向騙徒補發新卡，隨後，他便可執行需要經一次性密碼授權的交易。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4542 HSBC _ about and device fraud frontend/templates/What
#: know mobile need security settings to you
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Please be alert and talk to your mobile provider immediately if you "
"suddenly find you do not have network connectivity and are not receiving "
"calls or text messages for unusually long periods."
msgstr "如您發現裝置的網絡連線中斷，並且在異常 長時間內並無來電或文字訊息，便應提高警覺並即時與服務供應商聯絡。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4545 HSBC _ about and device fraud frontend/templates/What
#: know mobile need security settings to you
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Also, please change the password you use for accessing the mobile service"
" portal. This is because fraudsters can activate an SMS forwarding "
"service or enquire SMS content by logging on to the online service portal"
" which are provided by some Mobile service providers."
msgstr "此外，請更改用以連接流動服務入口網站的密碼。這是因為騙徒只需成功登入某些流動服務供應商提供的網上服務入口網站，便能啟動短訊轉寄服務或查詢短訊內容。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4548 HSBC _ about and device fraud frontend/templates/What
#: know mobile need security settings to you
msgid ""
"It’s also recommended that you do not switch off your phone if you are "
"receiving numerous unknown calls, which could be a ploy to make you turn "
"off your phone so you don't notice a tampered network connection."
msgstr "亦建議您在接連收到不明來電後切勿關掉電話：可能是有人故意多次致電以誘使您關機，令您及後難以察覺裝置連線被人截停。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4564 HSBC _ about and device fraud frontend/templates/What
#: know mobile need security settings to you
msgid ""
"<strong>\n"
"                                                Maintain your device\n"
"                                            </strong>"
msgstr ""

#: - Cyber HK.html:4656 HSBC _ about and device fraud frontend/templates/What
#: know mobile need security settings to you
msgid "What HSBC is doing to keep your mobile banking secure"
msgstr "滙豐保障你的流動理財體驗"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4674 HSBC _ about and device fraud frontend/templates/What
#: know mobile need security settings to you
msgid ""
"<strong>\n"
"                                                Mobile Security Key\n"
"                                            </strong>"
msgstr ""

#: - Cyber HK.html:4678 HSBC _ about and device fraud frontend/templates/What
#: know mobile need security settings to you
msgid ""
"Available via the HSBC HK App, Mobile Security Key provides you with a "
"safe and convenient way to log on to online and mobile banking. It also "
"allows you to generate unique, one-time security codes to authenticate "
"important transactions and access a full range of online and mobile "
"banking services securely."
msgstr "流動保安編碼是HSBC HK app的內置功能，方便您登入及享用網上及流動理財服務，您亦可以獲取一次性保安編碼，讓您於處理重要交易時獲得額外保障。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4693 HSBC _ about and device fraud frontend/templates/What
#: know mobile need security settings to you
msgid ""
"The new iOS Face ID lets you authenticate your identity and access your "
"digital banking in seconds, just by looking at your screen. You can also "
"log on to our app and confirm transactions using fingerprint "
"authentication with iOS Touch ID and Android™"
msgstr ""
"透過全新iOS Face ID進行身分認證，只需注視螢幕，就可以登入及使用香港滙豐流動理財應用程式；您亦可透過iOS Touch "
"ID及Android™"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4700 HSBC _ about and device fraud frontend/templates/What
#: know mobile need security settings to you
msgid ""
"If you are using biometric for log on or confirming transactions, we "
"highly recommend you only register your own biometric print onto your "
"mobile."
msgstr "如您使用生物認證功能以作登入或確認交易，強烈建議您在流動裝置上只登記自己一人的生物認證資料。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4703 HSBC _ about and device fraud frontend/templates/What
#: know mobile need security settings to you
msgid "Note:"
msgstr "註："

#: - Cyber HK.html:4706 HSBC _ about and device fraud frontend/templates/What
#: know mobile need security settings to you
msgid "1.Not available on all Android devices."
msgstr "1. 並非在所有Android裝置上提供。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4721 HSBC _ about and device fraud frontend/templates/What
#: know mobile need security settings to you
msgid ""
"After activating your Mobile Security Key or if we detect any suspicious "
"activity on your HSBC Online and Mobile Banking and other selected HSBC "
"Digital Banking platforms, you may need to further verify your identity "
"before you can enjoy full access."
msgstr "當您啟動「流動保安編碼」，或我們偵測到您於滙豐網上及流動理財上有可疑動態，您可能需要進行身分驗證以使用滙豐流動及網上理財的全部服務。"

#: - Cyber HK.html:4732 HSBC _ about and device fraud frontend/templates/What
#: know mobile need security settings to you
msgid "Learn more about what HSBC mobile banking"
msgstr "深入了解滙豐正採取哪些措施，確保您享受到安全的流動理財服務"

